<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Waannisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waannisa Xaafeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggilee</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waannisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wan.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waannisa Xaafeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggile</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Waannisa Yesuusa, «As maaqqii as gancce bentteez Xooss Qaala» yeegii eriseeza. Yha Wonggilay xaafintteezay, eza nababiza asay Yesuusa as ashshizaya maaqqii ye7oda ginttintteez Xooss Na7a maaqqizana ammanod garkkennee eza ammanizitayis medhina de7o yezana unttii erodgarkke (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wonggilayis Tiina kifilay medhina Xoossa qaalaynnee Yesuusa petto maaqqeezana odii maaqqii, Yesuusa ashshizaya maaqqii ye7od ginttintteez Xooss Na7a maaqqeezana beeziza duma duma mallitayir fallisii beeziza. Xaafay, Yesuus Kiristtoosa fa ubbas tuma Xooss Na7annee Xooss adayir petto maaqqizana (1:1) afa qoncce odeeza. Yesuusa fa ubbas ta Afraamepp tiin yeza (8:58) yeegeeza. Wurssithal Toomaasa, «Ta Godayyo, ta Xoossayo» yeegii xeegeeza (20:28). Yeypp kaallii ma yha mallitaypp bentteez aafa odiz taarikkitay kaalliza. Yha kifilay pettii pettii asay Yesuusa ammanii eza kaallizita maaqqeezana odiza; ma yhankkitay ezar wayizii eqintteezaakkonnee wayizii ammanaam ixxeezako odiza. Shemppo 13-17 hellodayis Yesuusa aykintteez omath ezisi, e tamaaritayir ab garkk mino dabbotithi yezako, ma wonttitha gallas sotinttodaypp tiina giigintto qaalannee minthatho qaala unttisi odeezay fallisii beeziza. Wurissithi shemppitay Yesuusa aykkintteez baggannee pirddas shiiqeez baz, E sotintteezannee e denddo, yey garkkekka denddaypp guye fa tamaaritayis E bentteez benttitha odiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Waannisa Wonggilay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xamaaqiza Waannisannee Yesuusa tiina taamarita <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa ooso aykkeeza <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurisith qammita Yerusalaame heera <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Goday denddanne bentithi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa: Galila maaqqii fa tamaaritayis benttithi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Qaala Tiinapp yeza. Qaalaykka Xoossar yeza; ye Qaalay Xoosse. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Tiina Qaalay Xoossar yeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Xoossay ubba baz Qaala baggar medhdheeza. Medhintteez bazapp pettii bazkka e baggar medhinttekkabaz baaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ezar de7o yeza; ye de7ay asis poo7o. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Poo7ay dhuma poo7iza; dhumay poo7ana gamekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Xoossii kiitteez, pettii Waannisa giz asii yeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Asii ubbay E baggar poo7a ammanod garkk E poo7os markka maaqqii ye7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>E poo7o bagga markattodayis ye7eezaypp attin fa ubbas poo7o baaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>As ubbas poo7isiza tuma poo7ay alame yi7iza.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Ezkka alamel yeza. Alamaykka medhdhintteezay e baggara, zin alamaykka eza erekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>E faasitayiko ye7eeza, zin eesitay eza ekkekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Zin E fana ekkeezitaysinnee E suntha ammaneezitayis Xooss na7ita maaqqad garkk mawute inggeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Unttikka Xoossapp yelintteezaypp attin as yelinttiza wogay garkk dhiirath shenepp woy ashoppennee suuth shener yelinttekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Qaalay as maaqqeeza; aadho keehetitharannee tumatithar kumii nu gancce yezeeza. E adayis pettii na7a maaqqii ekkeez E bonchcha nu be7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Waannisa E bagga markkatteeza. Fa qaala dhoqqi uddii, «Taanii, ‹Taapp guyer yi7izay taapp tiin yeza gishos taapp aadhiza› gi markkatteezay yhaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Nuunii ubbitay E aadho keehetith kunithetithaypp anjjol afa anjjo ekkeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Xoossay higge Muse baggar inggeeza, zin aadho keehetithinnee tumatithii Yesuusa Kiristtoosa baggar ye7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Xoossa aafer be7eez as oonkka baaya; fa Aday lanqqe yez pettii Na7ay aadda E fa ubbas Xooss maaqqeezay eza qoncce odeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xamaaqiza Waannisa markketithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-8">Luq. 3:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Yerusalaame yez Ayihuditay halaqitay, Qeesitaynnee Lewitay, «Neenii oonoo?» gi, Waannisa oyicod garkk eziko kiittin, Waannisa unttisi markkatteez markkatithay yhaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Waannisa, «Taanii Kiristtoosa baaya» yeegii, milxi udii markkatteezapp attin kaddibe7ekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Unttikka, «Yeezin, ne oonoo? Ne Eelaasanee?» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Waannisa mahii, «Tana baaya» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ma unttii, «Ne ye7od ginttintteez nabay nenanee?» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Waannisa, «Wa77a» gi maheeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Yeezin, «Ne oonoo? Nuunii nuna kiitteezitayis odod garkk ne nena oona gee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Waannisa mahii, «Nabe Isayaasa geezay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">«‹Godayis oge luulisoytta!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">gi liizho demba uukkiza athay qaalay tana»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Ma Ferisaawe asitay kiitteez asay <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Waannisako, «Ne Kiristtoosa woy Eelaasa woy nabe baa ixiko, yeezin abis xammaqee?» gi oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Waannisa mahii, «Taanii haathar xammaqiza, zin yi eroowa asii yi gancce eqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>E taapp guyer yi7iza. Taanii hara attozin e caamma wodoro billodayis beezooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Yeyi ubbay Yordanoose borkkapp seko pino, Bitaana katama, Waannisa xammaqiza aqayid haneeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss dure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Waannisa wonttitha gallas Yesuusa eeko ye7odar bi7ii, «Alame nagara baranchchiza Xooss Duray yhaya! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Taanii, ‹Taapp guyer pettii asii ye7oda. E taapp tiin yeza gishos taapp aadhiza gi odeezay yhaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>E oonazako taanii erooya. Zin Isreele asayis eza qoncce kessodayis haathar xammaqttar ye7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Waannisa yhay garkk yeegii markkatteeza: «Geeshsha Ayyanay salopp holle garkk wodhdhodarannee ezal shemppodar ta be7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Yeyi hanodaypp tiina ta eza erooya. Zin haathar xammaqodayis tana kiitteez Xoossay, ‹Geesha Ayyanay wodhdhii ezar yezin neenii be7adayinnee Geeshsha Ayyanar xammaqoday eza› yeegii taas odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Ta yeyi hanodar bi7ii, E Xooss Na7a maaqqeezana markkattiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kaalleez tiina taamarita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Ma wonttitha gallas Waannisa fa tamaaritaypp nam7itayir wolla eqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yesuusa aadhodar Waannisa bi7ii, «Xooss duray yhayshshe!» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Nam7i Waannisa tamaaritay Waannisa gizana si7ii Yesuusana kaalleeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yesuusa fana kaallizita guye shirinttii bi7ii, «Yi ab koyinee?» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Unttii maaqqii, «Asitamaarayyo, ne aba yessade?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yhana yi7ii bo7oytta» yeegeeza. Unttii yhanigii E yeza aqa be7eeza. Ye gallas sa7ay taphphii saate heera maaqqiz gishos e lanqqe peezheeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Waannisa geezana si7ii, Yesuusana kaalleez nam77ii tamaaritaypp pettay, Simoon Phixiroosa isha Indiraase. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Indiraase tiina fa isha Simoonar wolihellii, «Nuunii Kiristtoosa denggeeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Indiraase Simoona Yesuusako ke7eeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesuusa Simoona bi7ii, «Neenii Yoona na7a Simoona; ne sunthay Kefa a gi xeeginttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Filphoosarannee Natina7eelara xeegeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Wonttitha gallas Yesuusa Galila biitta yhammadayis murtteeza. E Filphoosara denggii, «Tana kaalloba!» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filphoosa, Indirasennee Phixiroosa yezeez Beetesayda gizi katamapp ye7eez asii.<verse eid="JHN 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filphoosa Natina7eelara hellii, «Muse higge maxaafay gancce, ma nabitaykka ebaz xaafeez Yooseefa na7a Naazirete Yesuusa nu dengeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Naatina7eela mahii, «Naazirete katamapp lo77o baz kezodayis danda7inee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filphoosa, «Yi7ii bo7oba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesuusa Naatina7eela faako yi7izana bi7ii, «Gene baa tuma Isreele as yhaya!» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Naatina7eela Yesuusako, «Neenii tana aba eree?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesuusa mahii, «Filphoosa nena xeegodaypp tiina, neenii balase mithii oommo yeezin taanii nena be7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Naatina7eela mahii, «Asitamaarayyo, neenii Xooss Na7a! Neenii Isreele kaate!» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesuusa eeko, «Ta nena balase mithii oommo be7eeza geez gishos ne ammaninee? Neenii yhaypp aathibaz be7ada!» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Ma Yesuusa, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; salo dooyinttin, Xooss kiitanchchitay As Na7a afa kezodarannee wodhdhodar yi be7ada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa boss aqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Hayidzintha gallas Galila biitta Qaana katama bossi yeza. Yesuusa indat ye bossayid yeza. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesuusakka fa tamaaritayir wolla ye bossayid xeegintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Woyne ushshii wurin, Yesuusa indat Yesuusako, «Unttis woyne ushshii wureeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ta indatee, ne yhaydda gelippe? Ta woday haga hellekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Yesuusa indat ooso asitayiko, «E yinttis odeezibaz ababaz maaqqikokka oothoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Ayihuditay fa shaagishe wogas maadinttiza usuppun shuchch gaanitay ye aqayid yeza. Pettii pettii gaanay nam7i woy hayidzii xugga aykkiza. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesuusa ooso asitayiko, «Gaanitayid haathii kunthoytta» yeegeeza. Unttii gaanitayis doona hellodayis haathii kuntheeza. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yhatti duuqqii boss godayis inggoytta» yeegeeza. Unttii ezisi inggeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Boss godayis woyne ushshiko laamintteez haatha ganxxii bi7ii anapp ye7eezako erekka, zin haathii kuntheez ooso asitay eriza. Bossa goday machcho ekkizana xeegii, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>«Oonkka lo77o woyne ushshii asa tiinattii ushshiza. Yeezii asay uzhii aleezaypp guye haaxo ushsh inggiza. Zin neenii lo77o woyne ushshii yhanno hellodayis gaddeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesuusa yha tiina malata Galila biitta Qaana katama ootheeza; yeyida fa boncha beezeeza. E tamaaritay eza ammaneeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa fa indatira, fa ishitayirannee fa tamaaritayir wolla Qifirnahoome katama yhanigii xiqqa gallas gam7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xooss karapp zal7izita kesseeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar. 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luq. 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Ayihuditay bonchchiza Paaziqa Baalay ukkin Yesuusa Yerusalaame yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Yhanigii Xooss kara gancce gematita, harita, duritannee hollita bayizizitannee fa oydel bettii miishe laammizita denggeeza. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>E xurqafer ubbita u mehitayir Xooss karapp bayi7ii bale kesseeza. Miishe laammizitay xarpheezitakka shirii olii u miisha laaleeza. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Holle bayizizitana, «Yha hollita yhaypp kessoytta; ta Aday kara gabe mahippate» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>E tamaaritay Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Taanii ne karayis micinttiza mishay tana tama garkk michchiza giza» ginttinttii xaafintteezana akaakeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Yeypp guye, Ayihuditay mahii, «Ne yhaya oothodayis neesi mawute yezayis nuna aba malata oothii beezodee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesuusakka, «Yha Xooss kara laalloytta; taanii hayidzii gallasar mahii denthoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Maakka Ayihuditay, «Yha Xoossa Kara keexxodayis oytamanne usuppun laythi ekkeeza, zin neenii hayidzii gallasar denthode?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Zin Yesuusa odiza Xoossa karay fa asetithibaga. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Yey gishos, Yesuusa yhayiqopp denddeezaypp guye e tamaaritay E yeya geezana akaakeezannee Geeshsha maxaafayid xaafinttezannee Yesuusa odeezana ammaneeza.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yesuusa Paaziqa bonchchiza gallas Yerusalaame yezin, E ootheez mallita bi7ii gaame asay eza ammaneeza. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Zin Yesuusa as ubba eriza gishos unttan ammanekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>As wozina yeza baz E fa ubbas eriza gishos asibaz oonkka ezisi ododay garkk koyekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusarannee Niqodimoosara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Ferisaawitay baggapp maaqqeez, Ayihuditay halaqay, Niqodimoosa giz pettii athay yeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Niqodimoosa qamma Yesuusako yi7ii, «Asitamaarayyo, neenii Xoossay kiitteez asitamaare maaqqeezana nu eriza. Abis giiko, Xoossay ezar yezaam ixxiko yha ne oothiza mallita oothodayis danda7iza asii baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii nees turo odiza; oonkka maaqqii yelinttaam ixxiko Xooss kaatetitha be7adayis danda7ooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Niqodimoosa, «As cimii wayizii maaqqii yelinttodayis danda7ee? Fa indat ulo maaqqii gelii mahii yelinttodayis danda7inee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii nees turo odiza; oonkka haathapennee Geeshsha Ayyanapp yelinttaam ixxiko, Xooss kaatetith gelodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Ashopp yelintteezay asho; Ayanapp yelintteezay Ayyana. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Taanii, ‹Yi maaqqii yelinttodayis beeziza› gi yinttis odeezay gishos neenii malabaz giippe. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Carkko fa kozheez bagga carkkiza. Neenii giirtha si7inepp attin aayaypp yi7izako woy aaya yhanigizako erooya. Ayyanapp yelintteez ubbitay yey garkk» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Yeezin Niqodimoosa, «Yeyi wayizii hanodayis danda7ee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Neenii Isreelitay asitamaare maaqqittar yhaya eroosa? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Taanii neesi turo odiza; nu eriza baz odizannee be7eezi baz markkattiza, zin nu markketitha yi ekkooya. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Taanii yinttis sa7abaz odin yi ammanowabaz maaqqiko salobaz odin wayizii ammanodee? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Salopp wodhdheez As Na7aypp attin salo kezeezay oonkka baaya; [salo yez As Na7ay tana]» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14-15"/>Muse liizho denbal naase shoosh sotteezay garkk eza ammaneez ubbitay medhina de7o ekkoday garkk As Na7ay sotinttodayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Tay. 21:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Xoossay yha alame qadhdheez gishos fa Na7a petta aath inggod hellodayis cer doseezay eza ammaniza ubbitay medhina laattoday garkkepp attin dhabaamay garkke. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Xoossay fa Na7a yha alame kiitteezay alame pirddodayis baazin alama E baggar ashshodayisii.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Eza ammaniza oonkka pirddinttamii, zin Eza ammanoowa oonkka pettii Xooss Na7a ammanekka gishos yhatti pirddintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Pirddaykka yhaya: poo7o alame ye7eeza, zin as ooso iita maaqqeez gishos asay poo7opp aathii dhuma doseeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Iita baz oothiza oonkka poo7o ixxiza. Abis giiko, fa ooso pidhe kezaamay garkk poo7oko ye7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Zin tuma oothiz oonkka Xoossay kiitteezay garkk E ootheezana poo7o beezoday garkk poo7oko yi7iza.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa bagga markkateez xamaaqiza Waannisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayir wolla Yihuda biitta yhanigeeza. Ezayid xammaqttar unttar xiqqa wode gam7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Ma Waannisa Saleeme lanqqe yez Henoone yeegiz aqo gaame haath yeza gishos asa ezayid xammaqiza. Asaykka ye aqa yhanigii xammaqinttiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Ye wode Waannisa haga acinttekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Yeypp guye, Waannisa tamaaritaynnee Ayihude asay shaagishe woga bagga palameeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Waannisa tamaaritay Waannisako yhanigii, «Asitamaarayyo, Yorddanoosa borkkapp seko pino neer yezay, neenii ebagga markkatteezay, yezako xammaqiza. Asay ubbitaykka ezik yhanigiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Waannisa mahii, «Xoossay inggekka asii ababazikka ekkodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>‹Taanii Kiristtoosa baaya, zin eepp tiina kiitintteeza› maaqqeez gisho yi, yi ubbas taas markka. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Gelos giigeezanna ekkodayis giigeez athayssii. Ekkizayis laazanthay kale eqqii E giza si7eez wode lo7ithii ufayttiza. Yey gishos, yhayi ta ufayssay polintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>E gitatodayis taanii xiqqodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Afapp yi7izay ubbaypp afa. Sa7app bentteezay sa7abaz. E sa7abaz odiza. Salopp yi7izay ubbaypp afa. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>E fa be7eezbazinnee si7eezibaz markkattiza, zin e markketitha ekkizay baaya. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>E markketitha ekkiza oonkka Xoossay tuma maaqqizana beeziza. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Xoossay fa Geeshsha Ayyana ees makkekka inggiza gishos Xoossay kiitteezay Xooss qaala odiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Aday fa Na7a dosii ubba baz e kushayid gaddeeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Na7a ammaniza athayis medhina de7o yeza. Zin Na7a ammanoowa athayil afa Xooss kachchii ezal yezaypp attin E de7o denggaamii.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusarannee Samaare asito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Yesuusa Waannisasitaypp gaanggiza kaallizita faako shiishizannee xammaqizana Ferisaawitay si7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Maaqqikokka Yesuusa tamaaritay xammaqeenepp attin Yesuusa oonakka xammaqqekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesuusa asay ebaz giza si7ii Yihudapp denddii Galila yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Galila yhanigttar Samaarera aadhoday ezisi attambaz maaqqeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Yeyi gishos, Yayqqooba fa na7a Yooseefas inggeez gade lanqqe yez Sikaare giz Samaare katama yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Ye aqayid Yayqqoobas haath olla yeza. Yesuusa yedhdhitar daaburii ye haath ollatii lanqqe betteeza. Ye wode sa7ay usuppun saate heera.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Pettii Samaare asita ye ollaypp haath tikkodayis ye7eeza. Yesuusa ye asitiko, «Tana haathe ushshooye» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Ye wode Yesuusa tamaaritay miiz baz woonggodayis katama yhanigeezaza.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Ye asita mahii, «Neenii Ayihude as maaqqittar, Samaare maachchi maaqqiz tana wayizii haathe ushshoba gee?» yeegeeza. Yeya iza geezay Ayihuditay Samaaritayir wolihellowa gishshosi.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Neenii Xooss imotanee haathe tana ushshooye gizay oonazako ne ereezako eza ne woossodazin; ezikka neesi de7o inggiza haathii immadazin» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Ye asita maaqqii, «Godayyo, nees duuqqizabaz baaya; ollaykka ciimmo. Yeezin, de7o inggiz haath ne anapp denggodee? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Nuus yha haathii olla inggeez nu aday Yayqqoobapp neenii aadhinee? Ezinnee, e na7itaynnee e mehitay yha ollaypp uzheeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesuusa, «Yha haathaypp uzheez oonkka maaqqii saaminttoda. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Zin taanii inggod haatha uzhiz oonkka ubbarakka saaminttaamii. Taanii immad haathay e gancce medhinas de7o inggiz goggiz pultto maaqqada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Ye asita mahii, «Godayyo, taanii saaminttamay garkkennee haath tikkodayis yha aqa ye7aamay garkk taasi ye haatha inggoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesuusa iziko, «Yhanigii ne azina xeegii ye7oba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Ye asita mahii, «Taas azinii baaya» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesuusa iziko, «Taas azina baaya guussayid nees buuta baaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Nees tiin ichchin azinttay yeza. Yhatti neer yeza athay ne azine baaya. Neenii yhatti turo odeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ye asita mahii, «Godayyo, neenii nabe maaqqizana taanii ereeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Nu aditay yha derayil afa Xooss goynneeza. Zin yi Ayihuditay asii Xooss goynnodayis beeziza aqay Yerusalaame giza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesuusa, «Yhann astte tana ammanoba; yha derayil afa woy Yerusalaame Adayis goynnaam wode ye7oda. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Yi Samaaritay eroowazayis goynniza. Zin nuunii atotithi Ayihudepp yi7iz gishos nu erizayis goynniza. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Zin Ada tumar goynnizitay Ayyanarannee tumar goynnod wode ukkeeza; yhattekka helleeza. Yikkee, Aday koyizay yhay garkk oger goynnizita. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Xoossay Ayyana; ezis goynnizitay Ayyanarannee tumatithar goynnodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Ye asita mahii, «Kiristtoosa ginttiz ‹Masay› ye7odana taanii eriza. E yi7ii nuus ubba baz ododa» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesuusa, «Yha neer nashizay taanii eza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Unttii nashshodar, Yesuusa tamaaritay yhanigeez aqaypp maaqqeeza. Yesuusa maachchar wolla nashshodar u bi7ii malabaz geeza. Zin asttiko, «Abi koyee?» Woy Yesuusako, «Izir abis odinttee?» geezay oonkka baaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Yeypp guye, asita fa haath otana ashshii guye katama yhanigii asitayiko, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Taanii ootheez baz ubba taasi odeez atha be7adayis yedhdhoytta. E Kiristtoosa maaqqaddeshsha?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Asay katamapp kezii Yesuusako yhanigeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Yeyi hanodar, e tamaaritay Yesuusako, «Asitamaarayyo Xiqqa muntta mooye» yeegii woosseeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Zin E, «Taas yi eroowa katha ta miizay yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Yeyi gishos, E tamaaritay woli gancce, «Ezis miizibaz asii ko7o attenna?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Ta munttay tana kiitteezay shena oothonnee e ooso polodaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Yi, ‹Oyddii aginapp guye kathay maxxos helleeza› goosa? Zin taanii yinttis odiza; kathay kaxxii shiishos helleezaya lo7ithii bo7oytta. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Zerizayinnee maxxizay wolla ufayttod garkk maxxizay damooze ekkiza ma kathakka medhina de7os shiishiza. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Yikkee, ‹Pettay zeriza; yhankkay ma maxxiza› giz oday tuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Yinttii daaburekazana shiishoday garkk taanii yinttan azazeeza. Yhankkitay oothii daabureez aqo gelii yi u daaburssi aafa ekkeezitta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Ye asita, «E, taanii ootheez ubba baz odeeza» gi markkatteez gishos ye katama yez Samaare asaypp gaamitay Yesuusa ammaneeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Samaare asay Yesuusako yi7ii, fa kale gam7oday garkk Yesuusa woossin E ezayid nam77ii gallas betteeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>E odiza qaalay gishos tiinaasaypp gaame asay ammaneeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Ma unttii asttiko, «Yhatti nu ammanizay nu ubbas E giza si7eez gishosapp attin neenii markkatteez gishshos baaya. Ma E tuma yha alame ashshiza maaqqizana nuunii ereeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa pettii shuumay na7a patheeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Nam77ii gallasapp guye, Yesuusa yeypp kezii Galila biitta qiteeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Yesuusa fa ubbas, «Nabe fa biittal bonchchinttooya» yeegii tiinatii odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Yesuusa Galila helleez wode Galila asay eza mokkeeza. Abis giiko, Paaziqa Baale bonchchiza gallas unttii Yerusalaame yez gishos E ootheez baz ubbita be7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Yesuusa haathe woyne ushshiko laammeez aqo, Galila yezi Qaanna katama qiteeza. Qifirnahoome kaatay kara oothizi pettii shuumayis na7ay harggintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Yesuusa Yihudapp Galila ye7eezana ye shuumay si7ii eziko ye7eeza. Yhayqqodayis ukkeez fa na7a yhanigii pathod garkk Yesuusa woosseeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesuusa shuumayiko, «Xoossay oothiza mallabazinnee mala be7amixiko yi ubbara ammanaam» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Shuumay mahii, «Godayyo, ta na7ay yhayqqekka yeezin taar yedhdhooyee» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesuusa, «Ne kara qitoba; ne na7ay paxoda» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ye shuumay Yesuusa geezana ammanii fa kara yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>E fa kara yhammadar e ayllitay eziko yi7ittar ezar ogell hellii, «Ne na7ay paxeeza» geeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>E ayllita fa na7ayis aappun saater lo77eezako oyceeza. Unttii maaqqii, «Ziqin laappun saater mishay atteeza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Na7ay adayi Yesuusa faako, «Ne na7ay paxoda» geezay ye saatte maaqqizana akaakeeza. Yeyi gishos, ezinnee e kara as ubbitay ammaneeza.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Yeyi Yesuusa Yihudapp Galila yi7ii ootheez nam7intho malla.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa pettii sila atha patheeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa Ayihuditay bonchchiza baalayis Yerusalaame yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Yerusalaame Duritay Penge kale Ibraysxe doonar Beetesayida giz deelee yeza. Ye haathay lanqqe ichchin shemppo bessitay yeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>[Yeyid haathay eni7odana naagiza gaame harigntteezittay, to7itay, wobbitayinnee gundditay woyi7iza. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Abis giiko, pettii pettii toke Goda kiitanchchay teqintteez haatha wodhdhii eni7isiza. Haathay eni7odar tiin geleez athay fana aykkeez aba harggepekka paxiza.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Ye aqayid hasttamannee hosppun laythi harggintteez pettii athay yeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesuusa ye atha bi7ii, ma gaame wode harggintteezana erii athayiko, «Paxodayis koyinee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Harggintteez athay maaqqii, «Godayoo, haathay eni7odar tana haathay gancce oliza asii baaya. Taanii gelod hanodar haray taapp tiinattii geliza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Denddii eqqoba; ne arssa tookkii qitoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Athay izir ellis paxeeza; fa arssa tookkii qiteeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Yeyi maala gallasar haneeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Yeyi gishos, Ayihuditay paxeez athayko, «Yhayino sa7ay maala; neenii ne arssa tookkizay woga baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Zin athay, «Tana patheezay, ne arssa tookkii qitoba geeza» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Unttii eziko, «Nena, ne arssa tookkii qitoba geezay E oonoo?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Zin Yesuusa ye aqayid gaame as ganccer erisekkazar aadhii qiteez gishos athay fana patheezay oonazako erooya. <verse eid="JHN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Yesuusa guyepp ye atha Xooss Keetha denggii, «Yhatt, neenii paxeeza; yhaypp iita baz nena hellaamay garkk maaqqii nagara oothippe» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Yeypp guye, athay yhanigii fana patheezay Yesuusa maaqqeezana Ayihuditayis odeeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Yesuusa yeya maala gallas ootheez gishos Ayihuditay Yesuusa bay7ith aykkeeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yesuusa maaqqii, «Ta Aday ubba wode oothiza; taakka oothodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Yesuusa maala bonchcheka gishos aadda baazin Xoossa fa Ade gi fana Xoossar ukkulsseez gishos Ayihuditay eza wodhodayis tiinaasaypp miinthii koyiza.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss Na7ay mawute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; Na7ay fa aaddas abikka oothodayis danda7ooya. E fa Aday oothodar be7eezana aadda oothiza. Aday oothizana Na7aykka oothiza. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Aday fa Na7a qadhdhiza gishos E oothiz ootho ubba fa Na7a beeziza. Yi malabaz goday garkk E yhaypp aadhiz ooso fa Na7a beezoda. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Aday yhayqqeezita yhayiqopp denthii unttis de7o inggizay garkk Na7aykka fa koyizitayis de7o inggiza. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Aday Na7ayis pirdde mawute ubba inggeezapp attin E oonakka pirddooya. <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>Asay ubbitay Ada bonchchizay garkk Na7akka bonchchoda. Na7a bonchchowa oonkka Na7a kiitteez Adakka bonchchooya.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«Taanii yinttis turo odiza; ta qaala si7izitayinnee tana azazeezana ammanizay medhina de7o yeza. E yhayiqopp de7o piinggeez gishos pirddinttamii. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yhayqqeez asay Xooss Na7a qaala si7iz wode ye7oda; yeykka yhatte. Ye qaala si7izay de7or yezoda. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Adayis ees de7o yezay garkk Na7ayiskka ees de7o yezoday garkk inggintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>As Na7a maaqqiz gishos Aday Na7ayis pirdde mawute inggeeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>«Duufo yezitay e qaala si7ii dendod wode ye7od gishos yhaya malabaz giippate. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Lo77o ootheezittay de7or yezodayis ma iita ootheezittay pirdde ekkodayis duufopp dendoda.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>«Taanii ta mawuter ababazikka oothodayis danda7ooya. Xoossay taasi odeezay garkk pirddiza. Taanii tana kiitteezay koyiz baz oothizapp attin ta koyiz baz oothowa gishos ta pirdday tuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusas markkatteez asito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>«Taanii tabaz markkatiko ta markkatithay tuma baaya. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Ta bagga markkattizay hara yeza; E tabaz markkattizay tuma maaqqizana taanii eriza.<verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>«Yi Waannisako as kiittin E tumas markkatteeza. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Taanii yeya yinttis odizay, yi attod garkk geezapp attin as markkatithii taas koshsheez gishsho baaya. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Waannisa muqaadday garkk eexittar poo7eeza. Yi xiqqa wodes E poo7ayid ufaytteeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>«Zin taasi Waannisapp aadhiz markka yeza. Taanii oothod garkk ta Aday taasi inggeez oositay ta bagga markkattiza; Aday tana azazeezana beeziza.<verse eid="JHN 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>«Ma tana kiitteez Aday fa ubbas tabaz markkattiza. Yi E qaala ubbarakka si7ibe7ekka woy e malla bi7ibee7ekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>E azazeezana yi ammanoowa gishos e qaalay yi wozina gancce baaya.<verse eid="JHN 5:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>«Geeshsha Maxaapitaypp medhina de7o demmadbaz yinttis aazin unttan pilagiza; unttii tabaz markkattiza. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Zin yi de7o denggodays taako ye7odayis koyooya.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>«Asapp taanii bonchcho koyooya. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Zin taanii yi wozina gancce Xooss qadhe baza eriza. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Taanii ta Aday mawuter ye7eeza, zin tana mokkekkaya. Haray fa mawuter yi7iz wode eza mokkiza. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Yi pettay pettaypp bonchcho koyizitay, pettii Xoossapp yi7iz galata ekkodayis koyoozitay, wayizii tana ammanodayis danda7ee?<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>«Taanii ta Aday tiina yinttan mootizabaz yinttis aazippe. Yinttan mootoday yi ufayssar naagiz Muse. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Yi Muse ammaneez baz maaqqeezako E ta bagga xaafeez gishos tanakka ammanodazin. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Zin yi E xaafeezana ammanaam ixxiko ta qaala wayizii ammanodee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ichchin mukulo as muzeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luq. 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa Xibiradoosa giz Galila Abbapp seko pino piinggeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>E harggintteezitta fathor ootheez malla be7eez gishos gaame asay eza kaalleeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesuusa derell afa kezii, ezayid fa tamaaritayir wolla betteeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Ayihuditay bonchchiza Paaziqa Baale gallasay helleeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesuusa gaame asay faako yi7izana bi7ii Filphoosako, «Yha asa ubbita muzodayis gidiza katha anapp woommadee?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>E yeya Filphoosa faaccodayis geezapp attin E fa ubbas ab oothodazako eriza.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filphoosa maaqqii Yesuusako, «Hara attozin, Ommar ommar, pettii pettii baadhithi helthodayis, nam7i xeet diinaarer soollo wonggikokka gidaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Ma Yesuusa tamaaritaypp pettay, Simoon Phixiroosa ishay Indiraase, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Ichchin bangga soollora nam77ii molo aykkeez pettii na7ay yhaydda yeza, zin yha as ubbayis yey ab maaddodee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Asa bettithoytta» yeegeeza. Ye aqayid gaame maata yeza; asay ubbitay beteeza. Dhiirathi asitay taybay ichchin mukulo maaqqada. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesuusa soolla ekkii Xooss galatii maaqqii ezayid betteez asayis gisheeza. Molakka ekkii yhay garkk uddii inggin, asay fa koyeezay garkk meeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>U ubbitay mizheezaypp guye Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Pettii bazikka iitam garkk atteez gufa shiishoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Yeyi gishos, u ubba shiisheeza. Asay miin atteez bangga soollo gufa shiishii taphpho nam77ii leemate kuntheeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Asay Yesuusa ootheez malla bi7ii «Yhayi tuma yha alame ye7od ginttintteez nabe» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yesuusa u eza aykkii wolqqar kawutisodayis qoppeezana erii, fa aaddas derell afa maaqqii kezeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa abbal afar yedhdheeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Sa7ay omathodar Yesuusa tamaaritay abbako wodhdheeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Sa7ay qammeez gishos Yesuusa haga unttiko ye7ekka gishos e tamaaritay wogolo gancce gelii abba piinggii qifirnahooma yhammadayis denddeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Wolqqama carkko carkkeez gishos abbay eni7iza. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Ichchin woy usuppun kilo mitire maaqqoday garkk u abba pidhi yhanigeezaypp guye Yesuusa abbal afar yedhdhittar yi7izana bi7ii yashitteeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Zin E, «Yashittifatte, tana be» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Unttii ufayttii eza wogolo gancce gelsseeza; izir wogolay u yhanigiza abba gaxa helleeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa de7o soollo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Wonttitha gallas abbapp seko pino atteez gaame asay pettii wogolo aadda yezana be7eez gishosinne Yesuusa fa tamaaritayir wogolo gancce gelii, unttar yhanigozannee u fa aaddas yhanigeezana akaakeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Zin Xibaaradoosapp hara wogolitay Yesuusa Xooss galatin, asay soollo meez aqa ye7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Asay Yesuusa woy e tamaaritay ezayid baazana bi7ii, Yesuusa koyodayis wogolitayid gelii qifirnahooma yhanigeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Asay Yesuusa abbapp seko pino dengeez wode «Asitamaarayyo, yhana wudayid ye7eenee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesuusa maaqqii, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yi tana koyizay soollo mi mizheez gishospp attin malla be7eez gishshos baaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Dhabiza kathas oothippate, zin medhinas de7o inggiz kathas oothoytta. Xooss Aday E oothod garkk ezis mawute inggeez gishos ye katha As Na7ay yinttis immada eriseeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Yeezin unttii, «Nuunii Xooss ootho oothodayis ab oothodee?» yeegii Yesuusa oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesuusa maaqqii, «Yi oothod garkk Xoossay koyiz ooso yhaya: E azazeezana ammanoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Unttii mahii, «Nuunii bi7ii, nena ammanod garkk aba malla ne bessade? Ne ab oothodee? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid, ‹U maad garkk soollo salopp inggeeza› ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkk nu aditay liizho denba manna meeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yinttis salopp tuma soollo inggeezay ta Adaypp attin Muse baaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Yikkee, Xoossay inggiz soollay salopp wodhdheezay alamayis de7o inggiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Unttii mahii, «Godayyo, nuus ye soolla ubba gallas inggoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii de7o inggiza soollo; taako yi7iz oonkka ubbarakka nayinttenna. Ma tana ammaniza athay ubbarakka saaminttenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Zin taanii yinttis odeeza; yi tana be7eeza, zin ammanooya. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Ta Aday taasi inggiz ubbitay taako ye7oda; ma taako yi7iz oonakka bale dakkaamii. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Taanii ta koyiz baz oothodayis baazin tana kiiteezay koyiz baz oothodayis salopp ye7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Tana kiiteezay koyizay yhaya: taanii E taas inggeez ubbitakka wurssith gallas yhayiqopp denthoday garkkepp attin pettaka dhabisod garkk koyooya. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Yikkee, ta Aday koyizay yeya: Na7a bi7ii ammaniza ubbitay medhina de7o ekkoda; taanii ye ubbita wurssith gallas medhina de7os yhayiqopp denthoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii salopp wodhdheez soollo» geez gishos Ayihuditay eza zigireeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Unttii, «Yhayi nuunii e adannee e indat eriza Yooseefa Na7a Yesuusa baasannee? Yeezin, E wayizii, ‹Taanii salopp wodhdheeza› godayis danda7inee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Pettay pettayira zigiriza ashshoytta. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Tana kiiteez ta Aday taako ki7iza asapp attin taako ye7odayis danda7iza oonkka baaya. Taanii wurssithii gallas eza medhina de7os yhayiqopp denthoda. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Nabitay, ‹Xoossay as ubba tamarssoda› yeegii xaafeeza. Ada si7izayinnee ezipp tamaariza oonkka taako yi7iza. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Xooss lanqqepp ye7eezaypp attin Ada be7eezay oonkka baaya; e aadday Ada be7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>«Taanii yinttis turo odiza; tana ammaniza ooskka medhina de7o yeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Taanii de7o inggiz soollo. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Yi aditay liizho demba manno meeza, zin yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Salopp yi7iz soollay yhaya; ye soolla miiz oonkka yhayqqaamii. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Salopp ye7eez de7o soollay tana. Oonkka yha soollo miiko medhinas yezoda. Ma yha alamay de7or yezod garkk taanii yinttis immad soollay ta asho» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Ayihuditay, «Yha athay fa asho nu maad garkk nuus wayizii immadayis danda7ee?» yeegii woli gancce palameeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yey gishos, Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; As Na7a asho, yi maam ixxiko, e suutha yi uzhaam ixxiko, yinttis de7o baaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ta asho miiz athayisinnee ta suutha uzhiz athayis medhina de7o yeza. Taanii wursith gallas eza yhayiqopp denthoda. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ta ashay tuma muntta; ta suuthaykka tuma ushshii. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ta asho miiz athayinnee ta suutha uzhiz athay taar yeziza; taakka ezar yeziza. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>De7o Aday tana kiittin, taanii e baggar de7or yezay garkk, tana miiz athaykka ta baggar de7or yezoda. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Salopp wodhdheez soollay yhaya: yi aditay mi yhayqqeez mannay garkk baaya; yha soolla miiz athay medhinas yezoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesuusa qifirnahooma katama Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha yhaya taamarsseeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Medhina de7o qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Yesuusa tamaaritaypp gaame baggay yeya si7ii «Yhayi gelowa timirtte; yhayi oos gelee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritay yeyis zigireezana erii, «Yhayi yinttan dhubbinnee? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Yeezin, As Na7ay tiin yezabessa pude kezodar yi bi7ii waagodeshsha? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Ayyanay de7o inggiza; as wolqqa abikka maaddooya. Ta yinttis odiza qaalay de7o inggiz geeshsha Ayyanapp yi7iza. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Zin yi gancce ammanoozitay yeza» yeegeeza. Ammanoozitay oonanttazako Yesuusa tiinapp aykkii eriza. Ma fana aathii immaday oonazako eriza. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Maakka Yesuusa, «Aday yhanigoba geekka oonkka taako ye7odayis danda7ooya gi taanii odeezay yey gishshosi» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Yeyi gishos, Yesuusa kaallizitaypp gaamitay eza ashshii guye maaqqeeza; maaqqii eza kaallibe7ekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Yesuusa taphpho nam77ii fa taamarita, «Yinttikka ashshii yhammadayis koyinee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simoon Phixiroosa mahii, «Godayyo, nuunii ook yhammadee? Ne medhina de7o inggiz qaalar yeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Neenii Geeshsha Xoossay na7a maaqqeezana nuunii ammanizannee eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yinttan taphpho nam7ita maraxxekasa? Zin yinttipp pettay xalahe» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Yesuusa yeya geezay Simoona Na7a Asiqoroto Yihudasi. Yihuda Yesuusana aathii immadayis yezi taphpho nam77ii tamaaritaypp petta.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusarannee e ishitayira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Yeypp guye, Ayihuditay Yesuusa wodhodayis koyiz gishos E Yihuda ashshii Galilar yuuyeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Ayihuditay bonchchiza daase Baale bonchchinttodayis ukkeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Yeyi gishos, Yesuusa ishitay, «Ne tamaaritay neenii oothiz mallita be7ad garkk yhaypp denddii Yihuda biitta qitoba. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Paas erinttodayis koyiz as oonkka fa oosa qosooya. Neenii yhayitita oothii ne bagga alama erisoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>E ishitay yeya geezay ezal ammanaam ixxeez gishshosi.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Taas woday hellekkaya, zin yinttis ubba woday giiga. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Alamay yinttan ixxodayis danda7ooya, zin taanii alamay oosay iita maaqqizana markkattiz gishos tana ixxiza. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Yi baala yhanigoyttta; ta woday hellekkazay gishos taanii baala yhanggaamii» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>E yeya gi Galila atteeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa baala bonchchodayis yhanigeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>E ishitay baala bonchchodayis yhanigeezaypp guye Yesuusa oonakka erisekkazar qosor ye aqa yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Ayihuditay baala bonchchiza aqayid, «E aba yenee?» yeegii eza koyeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Asay kalkkashii ebagga odinttodar baggitay, «E lo77o as» godar atteez asay ma, «Wa77a, E woya balithiza» yeegiza. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Zin Ayihude halaqitayis yashitteez gishos oonkka ebagga geesha odinttodayis danda7ekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Baala bonchchii gaabba helithodar Yesuusa Xoossa keethi yhanigii taamarsso aykkeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Ayihuditay, «Yha athay timirtte tamaarekazar yhaya ubba wayizii ereennee?» yeegii malabaz geeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ta taamarssiza timirttay tana kiitteez Xoossapp yi7iz timirttepp attin tabaz baaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Xooss azazo oothodayis koyiz oonkka yha timirttay Xoossapp yi7izakonnee woy taanii taapp odizako eroda. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Paapp odiz oonkka fa ubba bonchcho koyiza. Zin fana kiitteezay bonchcho koyiz oonkka E tumanchcho; ezar worddo baaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Muse yinttis higge inggeeza, zin yinttipp oonkka higge naagekkaya. Yeezin abis tana wodhodayis koyee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Asay mahii, «Neell xalahe yeza; nena wodhodayis oonoo koyizay?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii pettii malla uddin yi ubbitay malabaz geeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Yinttii, yi na7ita dookalodgarkk Muse azazeeza. Zin dookalo yi mayzitay udo aykkeezapp attin Muse baaya. Yeyi gishos, yi maala gallas dhiirath na7ita dookaliza. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Muse higgay kiitteez gishos yi maala gallas dookalizabaz maaqqiko, taanii pettii asii kunthi galla patheez gishos taar abis kaccee? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Tuma pirdde pirddoyttap attin as aafe bi7ii pirddippate» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa, E Kiristtoosa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Yerusalaame asaypp pettay pettay, «U wodhodayis koyiz athay yhaya baasa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Yeezako, e pidhdhe odiza; unttii eza abikka gooya. E Kiristtoosa maaqqizana halaqitay tuma erineshsha? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Kiristtoosa yi7iza wode E anapp yi7izako oonkka erooya, zin e anapp ye7eezako nu eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesuusa Xooss Keetha tamaarssittar fa qaala dhoqqi udii, «Tuma yi taanii oonazakonnee ta anapp ye7eezako erinee? Taanii ta mawuter ye7ekkaya, zin tana kiitteezay tuma; yi eza erooya. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Zin taanii E kiittin e lanqqepp ye7eez gishos eza eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Yeyi gishos, unttii eza aykkodayis koyeeza. Zin e woday haga hellekkazay gishos oonkka ezal afa kushe gaddekaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Zin gaame asay Yesuusa ammanii, «Kiristtoosa ye7odar yha athay ootheez mallitaypp gaanggiza mallita oothodennee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusana aykkodayis wotaaddaritay kiittintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Ferisaawe asay gaame asay Yesuusa oosay bagga kalkkashodar si7eeza. Qeese halaqitayinnee Ferisaawe asay eza aykkii acishodayis Xooss keetha naagizita azazeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii yinttar xiqqa wode gam7oda; yeypp guye tana kiitteezayiko yhammada. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Yi tana koyoda, zin denggaamii. Taanii yeza aqa yi ye7odayis danda7ooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Ayihuditay pettay pettayira, «yhayi nuunii denggowa aqo aba yhammad hanee? Girike katama gancce yez Ayihuditayiko yhanigii Girikita tamaarssodayis haninenee? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>‹Yi tana koyoda, zin denggaamii› ma, ‹Taanii yezabessa yi ye7odayis danda7ooya› guussay abi guusso?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">De7o haath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Baala bonchchiza gallasitaypp wolqqamanne wurssith gallas Yesuusa denddii, fa qaala dhoqi uddii, «Saamintteez oonkka taako yi7ii uzho. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Tana ammaniza oonkka geeshsha Maxaafe geezay garkk de7o inggiz pultto haathay e ganccepp goggoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>E yeya geezay eza ammaneezitay ekkodayis yez geeshsha Ayyaanabagga. Yesuusa haga bonchchintteka gishos ye wode geeshsha Ayyanay ingginttekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">As gancce shaakintto medhintteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Ye asaypp gaamitay E giza si7ii, «Tuma yhayi nabe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Yhankkitay ma, «Yhayi Kiristtoosa» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Zin atteez asay ma, «Kiristtoosa Galilapp ye7odenee? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, ‹Kiristtoosa Dawite sheeshapp Dawitte yezeez Beeteleme katamap ye7oda› yeegosanee?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Zini, Yesuusa gishos asay woli gancce shaakintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Ye asaypp pettay pettay eza aykkodayis koyeeza, zin oonkka ezal afa kushe gaddekaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihude halaqitay ammanekaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Xoossa Keethi naagizitay qeese halaqitayikorannee Ferisaawitayiko guye maaqqii yi7in unttii, «Abis eza ke7ekkasa?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Xoossa Keethi naagizitay unttiko, «Yha athay odizay garkk oonkka odinttooya» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Ferisaawe asay mahii, «E yinttanakka balitheenee? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Ayihude halaqqitaypp woy Ferisaawe asaypp eza ammaneez as yenee? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Muse higge eroowa yha asay baaditteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Ferisaawitaypp pettay qamma Yesuusako yhanigeez Niqodimoosa unttiko, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Pettii asii giz baz si7ekkazar woy E ab ootheezako erekkar tiinattii ezal afa pirddizay nu higgayid yenee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Unttii maaqqii, «Neekka ma Galila biitta aso? Galila biittapp nabe kezaamiza geeshsha Maxaafaypp pilagii denggoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Binii pettii pettii maxaafitayid Waan 7:53 baaya.</char></note>Ubbitay fa kara fa kara qiteeza.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Lagititar aykintteez asito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yesuusa Woyira Derell afa qiteeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Ma wonttitha gallas guura Xoossa keethi maaqqeeza. Gaame asay eziko yi7in bettii unttan taamarsseeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Higge asitamaaritayinnee Ferisaawe asay lagitodar aykkeez pettii asito eziko ke7eeza. U as ubbay tiina izo essii, <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>«Asitamaarayyo, yha asita lagitodar nu aykkeez. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Muse higgay yhann garkk asita shuchchar cadinttii yhayqqod garkk kiittiza. Yeezin, neenii waagee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>U yeya geezay Yesuusana paaccii eza mootizabaz demmadayisii. Zin Yesuusa zuggii fa biradhdher sa7all xaafeeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>U eza mahii mahii oyicii ashshaamii ixxin, pude dhoqqi gi, «Yi gancce nagara oothekka as tiinatii izo shuchchar shoco» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Maakka zuggii sa7all xaafeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Unttii yeya si7eez wode cimitaypp aykkii pettay pettay kezitar wureeza. Yesuusa aadda ye aqayid eqqeez asitir atteeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>E pude dhoqi gi asitiko, «Yhan astte, asay ana yhanigeenee? Neell pirddeez oonkka baasa?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Ya asita, «Godayyo, oonkka baaya» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesuusa mahii, «Taankka neell afa pirddaamii. Qitoba; yhannipp maaqqii nagara oothippe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa alames poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Maakka Yesuusa asayiko, «Taanii alames poo7o. Tana kaalliza oonkka de7o inggiz poo7ana dengodaypp attin dhuma gancce wutenna» yeegii odeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Ferisaawe asay, «Ne nebaz markkattiza, zin ne markkatithay tuma baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii tabaz markkattikokka ta markkatithay tuma. Abis giiko, taanii anapp ye7eezako ma ana yhanigizako eriza, zin yi erooya. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Yi as qofal pirddiza; taanii pettii asallakka pirddaamii. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Taanii pirddiza baz maaqqikokka ta pirdday tuma. Abis giiko, tana kiitteez ta Aday taar yezaypp attin taanii ta aaddas baaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Nam77ii as markkatithii miinggiza yey yi higgayid xaafintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Taanii tabaz ta ubbas markkattiza; ma tana kiitteez ta Aday tabaz markkattiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Unttii, «Ne aday aba yenee?» yeegii eza oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesuusa mahii, «Yi tana woy ta Ada erooya. Tana eriza maaqqeezako, yi ta Adakka erodazin» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesuusa Xoossa Keethi muxaata miishe oliz saaxine yez bessa yeya taamarsseeza. E qammay haga hellekkazay gishos oonkka eza aykkekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Maakka Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yhammadazin; yi tana koyoda, zin yi atotithi dengaamii yi nagarara yhayqqoda. Taanii yhanigiza aqo yhammadayis yi danda7ooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Ayihude halaqitay, «E, ‹Taanii yhanigiza aqo yi yhammadayis danda7ooya› yeegeeza. E fana fana fa aaddas wodhodayisonee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yesuusa mahii, «yi sa7app; ta afappe. Yi yha alamaypp, ta yha alamaypp baaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Yi atotithi dengaam yi nagarara yhayqqod gi ta yinttis odeezay Yhayisii. Taanii Tana yi ammanaam ixxiko yi atotith dengaamii yi nagarara yhayqqoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Unttii, «Neenii oonoo?» yeegii oyiceeza. Yesuusa maaqqii, «Taanii, tiinapp yinttis odeezay tana. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Taanii yi baz odii pirddiza baz gaame baz yeza. Zin tana kiitteezay tumanchcho; ma ta eepp si7eezan aadda alamayis odiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Yesuusa fa Adaybagga odizana u akaakekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Yeyi gishos, Yesuusa unttiko, «Yi As Na7a pude dhoqi oothiza wode Taanii Tana Maaqqeezana yi eroda. Maakka taanii ta silixaaner abikka oothodannee ta Aday tana tamaarsseezana odiza yi eroda. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Tana kiitteezay taar yeza. Taanii ubba wode eza ufayssiza baz oothiza gishos E tana ta ubbas ashshekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Yesuusa yeya ododar si7eez gaame asay eza ammaneeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nagara aylletithap kessii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yesuusa fana ammaneez asitayiko, «Yi ta timirttayis kiittinttiko tuma tana kaallizita. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Yi tuma eroda; tumaykka yinttan wozii ekkoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Unttii mahii, «Nuunii Afraame sheeshii; nuunii ooskka ayllitibe7ekkaya. Ne waagii, ‹Yi wozinttoda gee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; nagara oothizi oonkka nagara aylle. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Aylle medhinas kara asar yezooya, zin na7ay medhinas kara asar yeziza. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Na7ay yinttan woziko yi tuma wozinttoda. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Yi Afraame sheesh maaqqeezana taanii eriza. Zin ta qaalay yi wozina gancce baazay gishos tana wodhodayis koyiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Taanii ta Aday tana beezeezana odiza, zin yinttikka yi adaypp si7eezan oothiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Unttii mahii, «Nu adayi Afraame» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesuusa unttiko, «Yi Afraame na7ita maaqqeezako E ootheezana oothoda. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Zin Xoossapp si7eez tuma odeez tana yi wodhodayis koyiza. Afraame yhay garkk oothekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Yinttii, yi adayi ootheezana oothiza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Unttii mahii, «Nuunii lagiter yelintteez na7ita baaya; nuus pettii Aday Xoossay aadda yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Xoossay tuma yi ade maaqqeezako yi tana qadhdhoda; abis giiko, ta Xooss lanqqepp yi7ii yhaydda yeza. Tana E kiitteezapp attin taanii ta mawuter ye7ekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Taanii giza yi si7odayis kozhoowa gishos ta giz baz yinttis gelooya. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Yinttii, yi aday xalehay na7ita. Ma yinttii, yi adayi amottizbaz oothodayis koyiza. E tiinap aykkii shemppo wodhiza. Tuma ezar baazay gishos E tuma ixxiza. Worddo ezis medho maaqqeez gishonnee E worddo adenne worddo odinttitar paap odinttiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Taanii turo odiza, zin yi tana ammanooya. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Yinttapp, ‹Neenii nagara oothodar ta be7eeza› godayis danda7izay oonoo? Taanii turo odinttizabaz maaqqiko tana abis yi ammanoosa? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Xooss asii Xoossay giz baz si7iza. Yi Xooss as maaqqekka gishos Xoossay giz baz si7ooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Afraamepp tiina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayihuditay mahii, « ‹Neenii Samaare asii; neell tuna ayyana yeza› guusayid buuta yenee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesuusa unttiko «Taal afa tuna ayyana baaya. Taanii ta Ada bonchchiza, zin yi tana kawushshiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Taanii ta ubbas bonchcho koyooya; taanii bonchchinttod garkk koyizaynnee taas pirddizay yeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; ta qaala naagiz oonkka yhayqqaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Ayihuditay mahii, «Neell afa tuna ayyana yezana nuunii yhatti ereeza. Afraame yhayqqeeza; nabitaykka yhayqqeeza. Zin neenii, ‹Ta qaala naagiz oonkka yhayqqaamii› yeegiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Neenii yhayqqqeez nu ada Afraamepp aadhinee? Nabitaykka ma yhayqqeeza. Neenii nena oona gi qoppee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii tana bonchchiko ta bonchchay cere. Yi, ‹Nu Xoossa› giz ta Aday E tana bonchchiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Yi eza eraami ixxiko taanii eza eriza. Taanii eza erooya giiko yi garkk worddotiza. Zin taanii eza eriza; ma e qaallakka ta naagiza. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Yi adayi Afraame ta yi7ith gallasa bi7ii ufayttodayis amotteeza; bi7ikka ufaytteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ayihuditay mahii, «Hara attozin, nees ishatam laythi kumekkazin wayizii Afraame be7eeza gee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; Afraame yelinttodaypp tiin taanii yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Yeyi gishos, unttii Yesuusa shocodayis shuchchi ekkeeza. Zin Yesuusa unttapp geemmii Xoossa keethapi kezii qitteeza.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa to7a maaqqii yelintteez atha patheeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesuusa yhanigittar yelintteezaypp to7a maaqqii yez pettii atha be7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>E tamaaritay, «Asitamaarayyo, yha athay to7a maaqqii yelinttod garkk nagara ootheezay oonoo? E oothenenne eza yeleezitay ootheenee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesuusa, «Xoossa ooso ezal afa benttod garkkepp attin E woy eza yeleezitay nagara ootheez gishos baaya. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Gallasa yezin tana kiitteezay oosa ta oothodayis beeziza. Oonkka oothodayis danda7oowa qammay yi7iza. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Taanii alamayid yezar alamayis poo7o» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Yesuusa yeya gi sa7a cutteeza. Fa cuchchayir laafa biitta laakithii ye urqqayir to7a athay aafa tizheeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Yeezii, «Yhanigii Salihoome giz teqintteez haatha ne aafa meecinttoba» yeegeeza. (Salahoome guussay kiitintteeza guusii) Yeyi gishos, athay yhanigii fa aafa meecinttii bi7ittar maaqqeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Athay shooritaynnee athay tiin woossodar be7eez asay, «yhayi bettii woossiza atha baasa?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Pettii pettii asay, «yhayi eza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Yhankkitay ma, «Wa77a, yhayi eza aazizapp attin eza baaya» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Zin athay, «Ee, tana» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Unttii eziko, «Yeezin ne aafay wayizii be7eenee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>E mahii, «Yesuusa giz athay xiqqa urqqa laakithii ta aafa tizhii, ‹Salihoome yhanigii ne aafa meecinttoba› yeegin, taanii yhanigii meecinttii bi7ii atteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Unttii eziko, «E aba yenee?» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Athay, «Taanii erooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ferisaawe asay haneezibaza erodayis koyeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Unttii tiin to7a, zin yhatti be7eez atha Ferisaawitayiko kanggeeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Yesuusa urqqa laakithii athay aafa patheez gallasay maala gallasii. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Yeyi gishos, athay wayizii be7eezako Ferisaawe asay eza mahii oyiceeza. Athay unttiko, «E ta aafate xiqqa urqqa tizheeza. Ta aafa meecinttii yhatti bi7iza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Ferisaawitaypp pettay pettay, «yhaya ootheez athay maala higge naagoowa gishos Xoossapp ye7ekkaya» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Zin yhankkitay, «Nagaranchcho asii yhay garkk mallita wayizii oothodayis danda7ee?» yeegii woli gancce shaakintteeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Yeyi gishos, Ferisaawe asay athayiko, «E ne aafa bi7iseez gishos ne ebaz waagee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Athay, «E nabe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ayihude halaqitay, e indatinnee ada xeegii oyicod gatho, athay tiin to7a maaqqeezannee yhatti E bi7izana ammanekaya. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Unttii e indatonnee e adayiko, «Yi ‹To7a maaqqii yelintteeza› giz yi na7ay yhaya? Yeezin, yhatti wayizii be7eenee?» yeegii oyiceeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Eza yeleezitay, «yhayi nu na7a maaqqeezannee to7a maaqqii E yelintteezana nu eriza. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Zin yhatti E wayizii be7eezako ma e aafa oonii patheezako nuunii erooya. Eza oyicoytta. E fana ereez as maaqqeez gishos fabaz ododayis danda7iza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Eza yeleezitay yeya geezay Ayihuditayis yashitteez gishshosi. Abis giiko, Ayihuditay, Yesuusana E Kiristtoosa yeegii markkattiz asii yezako ye atha Ayihuditay Woosa keethapp bayi7odayis qofa acceeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Eza yeleezitay, «E fana ereez asii; eza oyicoytta» yeegeezay yhaya.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Yeyi gishos, to7a maaqqii yelintteez atha unttii mahii xeegii, «Tuma ododayis Xoossa bonchoba; yha athay nagaranchcho maaqqizana nu eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Athay mahii, «E nagaranchcho maaqqeezana, ta erooya. Taanii to7a maaqqeezannee e yhatti bi7izana aadda eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Unttii mahii, «E nees ab ootheenee? E ne aafa wayizii patheennee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>E unttiko, «Taanii yinttis odeeza, zin yi si7ibe7ekkaya. Abis maaqqii maaqqii si7odayis koyinnee? Yinttikka e tamaare maaqqodayis koyinee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Unttii eza cazhii, «Ne ye athay tamaare; nuunii Muse tamaare geeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Xoossay Muses odeezana nuunii eriza, zin yha athay E anapp ye7eezakokka nu erooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Athay unttiko, «E anapp ye7eezako yinttii eroozay malabaz, zin E ta aafa patheeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Xoossa bonchchizannee E koyiz baz oothiza atha Xooss si7eezapp attin nagara oothizita si7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Salo sa7a medhintteezaypp to7a maaqqii yelintteez as aafe patheezay oonkka baaya. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Yha athay Xoossapp kiitinttekkazako pettibazikka oothodayis danda7ooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Unttii maaqqii, «Neenii nagarara yelinttii dicceezay nuna tamaarssodayis koyinee?» yeegeeza. U eza Ayihuditay Woosa keethapp kesseeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wozina to7atithi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesuusa unttii atha bale kesseezana si7ii eza hellii, «As Na7a ne ammaninee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Athay Yesuusako, «Godayyo, ta Eza ammanod garkk E oonoo? Taas odooye?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesuusa athayko, «Ne Eza be7eeza; yha neer odinttizay Eza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Athay mahii, «Godayyo, ta ammaniza» yeegii Yesuusas goynniza.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesuusa, «To7itay be7adgarkk bi7izitay to7oday garkk pirddodayis yha alame ta ye7eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Ezar yezi xiqqa Ferisaawe asitay yeya si7ii, «Nu to7annee?» yeegii woli oycicheeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesuusa, «yi to7ita maaqqeezako yinttis nagara baaya. Zin yhatti yi bi7iza giz gishos yi, yi nagarara yi yeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Henggizayanee e durita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yesuusa, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; dur kale gancce penger baazin hara oger geliz oonkka kayizonnee paanno. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Yeya maaqqozin penger gelizay durita heenggizaya. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Penge naagizay ezisi penga dooyiza; duritaykka E qaala si7iza. E fa durita u sunthayir sunthayir xeegiza; unttan kaalithii bale kessiza. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>E ootheez faasita bale kesseezaypp guye u tiina tiina yedhdhiza. Unttikka E qaala eriza gishos Eza kaalliza. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Hara as qaala unttii eroowa gishos eep haakkizapp attin E lassa kaallooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesuusa unttis yha aazisa odeeza, abi odeezakko unttii akaakekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Mahii Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; ta duritayis penge. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Taapp tiini ye7eez ubbitay kayizonnee paanno, yeya maaqqadar duritay unttan si7ibe7ekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Pengey tana; ta baggar geliza oonkka attoda. E ta baggar gelodannee kezoda; lo77o heengginttiz aqo demmada. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Kayzo kasttodayis, shukkodaysinnee dhabisodayis yi7izap attin harabazis ye7ooya. Taanii unttis de7o yezod garkkerannee kumii fucod garkk ye7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>«Taanii lo77o henthancho; lo77o henthanchchay fa duritay gishos fa shemppo aathii inggiza. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Kera heenggiz as duritay godanne henthanchcho baazay gishos fuge yi7iko bi7ii durita ashii hali7iza. Yeyi gishos, suudhume durita aykkii laaliza. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Kera heenggizay miishes heenggiz gishonnee duritaybaz eza qofisoowa gishos durita ashii laasiza.<verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15"/>«Taanii lo77o henthanchcho. Ta Aday tana erizay gark taankka ta Ada eriza. Yey garkkekka, ta ta durita eriza; ta duritaykka tana eriza. Taanii ta duritay gishos ta shemppo aathii inggiza. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Yha wudayid baa hara duritay taas yeza. Taanii unttanakka ko7odayis beeziza. Unttii ta qaala si7oda; unttii pettii wude maaqqada; henthanchchaykka petta.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>«Taanii ta shemppo aathii inggii mahii ekkiz gishos ta Aday tana doseeza. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Ta dosiza ta shemppo aathii inggizaypp attin taapp oonkka ekkenna. Ta ta shemppo aathii immadayisinnee mahii ekkodayis silixxaanee taas yeza. Taanii oothod garkk ta Aday tana kiitteezay yhaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Yeya E geez gishos Ayihuditay gancce maakka shaakotethii medhintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Unttapp gaame baggay, «Ezar tuna ayyana yeza! E eeyiza! E giz baz abis si7inee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Yhankkitay ma, «Xalahe aykkeez as yhay garkk odinttooya. Tuna ayyana to7a aafe beezodayis danda7inee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa As Na7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Yerusalaame Xoossa Keethi orotheez gallasitay bonchchiza baale helleeza; ye wode sa7a barigo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesuusa Xoossa Keethi Solomone baaranddar yuuyiza. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Ayihuditay Yesuusa lanqqayid shiiqii eqqii, «Neenii nuna ayide hellodayis sidher gaddodee? Neenii Kiristtoosa maaqqiko ane nuus geeshshii odoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesuusa maaqqii unttiko, «Taanii yinttis odeeza; zin yi tana ammanooya. Taanii ta Aday taasi inggeez mawuter oothiza oosay tabaz markkattiza. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Zin taanii yinttis odeezay garkk yi ta dure maaqqekka gishos ammanooya. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ta duritay ta qaala si7oda. Ta unttan eriza; unttikka tana kaalliza. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Taanii unttis medhina de7o inggiza; unttii ubbarakka dhabaamii. Oonkka ta kushep unttan bonqqii ekkodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Unttan taasi inggeez ta Aday ubbap aadhiza oonkka ta Aday kushep unttan bonqqii ekkodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Taannee ta Aday petto» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ayihuditay Yesuusa shocodayis maakka shuchchi dentheeza. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Taanii oothod garkk ta Aday taasi inggeez gaame lo77o oosita yinttan oothii beeziza. Yeyititaypp aayay gishos tana shuchchar shocodayis koyinnee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ayihuditay mahii, «Nuunii nena ne lo77o ooso gishos shuchchar shocodayis koyooya. Zin neenii Xooss cazheez gishonnee as maaqqitar ne nena Xooss giz gishshosi» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Geeshsha Maxaafayid Xoossay, ‹Yi Xoossita› geezay xaafinttekkasa? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay medhinas laaminttaammii. Xoossay fa qaala inggeez asita, ‹Xoossita› gi xeegiko, <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Ta tana Xooss na7a geezayis, Aday maraxii yha alame kiitteez tana Xooss Na7a wayizii ‹Xoossa ne cazhiza› yeegee? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Taanii ta Aday oothizana oothaam ixxiko tana ammanippatte. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Zin taanii oothizabaz maaqqiko yinttii tana ammanaam ixxikokka, ta Aday taar yezannee taakka ta Adayir yezana yi erod garkk ta oosa ammanoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Maakka unttii eza aykkodayis koyeeza, zin E unttapp buuttii kezeeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Waannisa tiin xammaqiza aqa, Yorddanoosa borikap seko pino Yesuusa piinggii ezayid gam7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Gaame asay Yesuusako yi7ii, «Waannisa malata oothekkaya, zin E yha athayabaz odeezbazay ubbay tuma» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Ezayid gaame asay Yesuusa ammaneeza.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Alaazara yhayiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Bitaana heera Alaazara giz pettii athay harggintteeza. Bitaana Mayiramirannee I mishshitti Marttara yeza heera. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Mayrama Goday toka shitto tizheez fa binanayirakka e toka ucceezanno. Harggintteezay I isha Alaazara. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Yey gishos, mishunthikka, «Godayyo, ne dosizay harggintteeza» gi Yesuusako azazeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesuusa yeya si7ii «Yha harggay, Xoossaynnee e Na7ay bonchchnttod garkkepp attin yhayiqos helithiz harige baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesuusa Martta, I mishshitonnee Alaazara qaadhiza. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Zin Alaazare harggintteeza gin Yesuusa si7ii fa yeza aqo nam77ii gallas gam7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Mahii Yihuda biitta wolla yhammada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>E tamaaritay mahii, «Asitamaarayyo, xiqqa wodepp tiin Ayihuditay nena shuchchar shoccii wodhodayis koyeezannee; yhattekka gede yhammadee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesuusa, «Pettii gallasa gancce taphpho nam77ii saate baasannee? Gallas yedhdhiz asii yha alame poo7a bi7iza gishos dhubinttaamii. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Zin qamma yedhdhiz oonkka poo7o baazay gishos dhubinttiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Yesuusa yeya geezaypp guye unttiko, «Nu qadhdhiza Alaazare gentteeza, zin eza denthodayis taanii yhammada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>E tamaaritay mahii, «Godayyo, E gentteezbaz maaqqiko eesi lo77oda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Yesuusa Alaazare yhayqqeezay gishos yeya odeeza, zin unttisi cer gentta aaziza. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Yeyi gishos, Yesuusa qoncisii unttiko, «Alaazare yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Yi ammanod garkk taanii ye aqayid baa maaqqeezayis yi gishos tana ufayssiza. An yedhdhoytta; eziko wolla yhammada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Yeypp guye, Didimoosa ginttinttiz Toomaasa fa lagge tamaaritayiko, «Asitamaarayir yhayqqodayis nuukka wolla yhammada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa dendonnee de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Yesuusa Bitaana hellodar Alaazare mooginttin oyddii gallas maaqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bitaane Yerusallemepp hayidzii kilo mitire garkk haakkiza. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Gaame Ayihuditay Marttannee Mayramo u ishay yhayqqeezayis minthathodayis ye7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Martta Yesuusa ye7eezana si7ii eza mokkodayis kezeeza, zin Mayrama keetha atteeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Martta Yesuusako, «Godayyo, neenii yhaydda yeza maaqqeezako ta ishay yhayqqaam. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Zin yhatti maaqqikokka neenii woossiza baz Xoossay nees immadana taanii eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesuusa, «Ne ishay yhayiqopp dendoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Martta eziko, «Wurssith gallas E yhayiqopp dendodana ta eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesuusa iziko, «Taanii dendonnee de7o; tana ammaniza oonkka yhayqqikokka de7or yezoda. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Ma de7or yezayinnee tana ammaniza oonkka yhayqqaam. Yeya ne ammaninee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Martta mahii, «Godayoo, ee taanii ammaniza! Neenii Xooss Na7a, alame ye7odayis yeza Kiristtoosa maaqqizana taanii ammaniza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Martta yeya geezaypp guye, yhanigii fa mishshitto geema xeegii, «Asitamaaray yi7ii nena koyiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mayrama yeya si7ii ellisii denddii Yesuusako yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Ye wode Yesuusa Martta eza Mokkeez aqo yeza; haga heera hellekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Mayramo minthathitar izir kara yezi Ayihuditay, iza denddii ellisii bale kezeezaya bi7ii, duufo yhanigii yeekkodayis haniza aazin izo kaallii kezeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mayrama Yesuusa yeza aqa yhanigii eza bi7ii e tokayil afa guphinggii, «Godayyo, neenii yhaydda yeza maaqqeezako ta ishay yhayqqaamizin» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesuusa Mayiraminnee iir yez, Ayihuditay yeekkizana bi7ii, fa wozinar iita micinttii, <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>«Aba moogeenee?» yeegii oyicin, «Godayyo, yi7ii bo7oba» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesuusa afuxeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Yeyi gishos, Ayihuditay, «E Alaazara ab garkk qadhdhizako bo7oytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Zin unttapp pettay pettay, «yhayi to7a bi7iseezay yha athay yhayqqaam garkk oothodayis danda7aamonee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Alaazara yhayiqopp dentheeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Maakka Yesuusa micinttii, Alaazare moogintteez duufa qitteeza. Ye duufay shuchchar gorddintteez komi7o. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesuusa, «Shuchcha denthoytta» yeegii azazeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Martta, «Godayyo, E yhayqqeezaypp oyddii gallas maaqqeez gishos yhatti zeeqqoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesuusa Marttako, «Ne ammanizabaz maaqqiko Xooss bonchcho be7adana taanii nees odekkasa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Unttii shuchcha denthin Yesuusa salo pude bi7ii, «adayyo, tana ne si7eez gishos nena galatiza. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ne ubba wode tana si7izana taanii eriza. Zin yhaydda eqqeez asay neenii tana azazeezana ammanoday garkk taanii u gishos yhaya giza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Yesuusa yeya geezaypp guye, fa qaala dhoqi uddii, «Alaazara, yhana kezoba!» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Yhayqqeez athay zidhithatir kushaynnee tokay shalor acinttii yezin e aafe baggay goozintteezin duufaypp kezeeza. Yesuusa unttan, «Billoytta! Yhamme goytta!» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosal afa tobbeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luq. 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Yeyi gishos, Mayramiko ye7eez Ayihuditaypp gaamitay Yesuusa ootheezana bi7ii eza ammaneeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Zin unttapp pettay pettay Ferisaawitayiko yhanigii Yesuusa ootheezana unttisi odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Yeypp guye, qeese halaqitayinnee Ferisaawe asay shanggo shiishii, «Yha athay gaame malla oothizi gishos nu abi udoo? <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Nuunii eza si77i gi ashshiko as ubbay eza ammanoda. Ma Oroome biitta asay yi7ii nu Xoossa Karannee nu gada dhabisoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Unttapp pettay Qayyaafa gizayi, ye laythi qeese halaqa maaqqeezay, «Yi abikka erooya! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Asay ubbitay dhabizaypp as ubbay gishos pettii as yhayqqizay lo77o maaqqizana yi eroosa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>E yeya paapp geekkaya. Zin (ye laythi qeese halaqa maaqqiz gishos Yesuusa Ayihude as gishos yhayqqodayis beezizana tinbbite odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Ma Yesuusa Ayihude as aaddas baazin laalinttii yezi Xoossa asii ubba wollal shiishodayisnnee pettii asii oothodayis yhayqqoda.)<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Ye gallasapp aykkii unttii eza wodhodayis tobbeeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Yey gishos, Yesuusa Ayihuditay gancce geeshshar yuuyekkaya. Zin liizho deniba lanqqe yezi Efreeme heera yhanigeeza. Fa tamaaritayir ye aqayid gam7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Ayihuditay bonchchiza Paaziqa gallasay uukkeeza. Ma gaame asay fana qashodayis Paaziqa bonchchiza gallasay hellodaypp tiina ye biittapp Yerusalaame qitteeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Unttii Xoossa Keetha eqqii Yesuusa yi7itha naagiza gishos «Abi qoppee? Yesuusa baala bonchchodayis ye7oosa?» yeegii pettay petta oyiceeza. <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Qeese halaqitayinnee Ferisaawe asay Yesuusa aykkodayis, E yezabessa eriza oonkka paasi odod garkk azazeeza.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusana shitto tizheez asito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Paaziqa bonchchiza gallasipp usuppun gallas tiinattii, Yesuusa yhayiqopp dentheez Alaazare yezi heera, Bitaana qiteeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Ye aqayid unttii ees kaho giigiseeza. Alaazare Yesuusar wollal munttal betteezin Martta unttan mokkiza. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Mayrama narddoosa giz gaame al7o geesh shitto ki7i Yesuusa toka tizheeza. Fa binnannayir e toka ucceeza; keetha ubbay shitto sawor tonkki geeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Zin Yesuusa tamaaritaypp pettay, Yesuusa aathii inggoday, Asiqoroto Yihuda, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Abis yha shittay hayidzii xeet dinnare bayizinttii, miishay manqqitayis ingginttoosa?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>(E kayzo maaqqeez gishos yeya geezapp attin manqqitayis qadhinttii geekkaya. E miishe quribo aykkiza maaqqeez gishos ubba wode ezaypp paas ekkiza.)<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesuusa, «Iza paas yeza baz ta moogo gallasis minjjeez gishos izo ashii ashshoytta. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Manqqitay ubba wode yinttar yezoda, zin taanii ubba wode yinttar yezaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Ye wode gaame asay Yesuusa Bitaana yezana si7ii gede yhanigeeza. Unttii Yesuusa aadda baazin E yhayiqopp dentheez Alaazarakka be7adayis yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Yeyi gishos, qeese halaqitay Alaazarakka ma wodhodayis tobbeeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Abis giiko, Alaazara baggar gaame Ayihuditay unttan ixxii Yesuusana ammaniza.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa bonchchor Yerusalaame geleeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luq. 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Wonttitha gallas Paaziqa bonchchiza aqo ye7eez woya Yesuusa Yerusalaame yhanigiza si7ii, <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Zambba haye ekkii eza mokkodayis kezeeza. Fa qaala dhoqqi udii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Hosaana! Xoossay galatintto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Goday sunthar yi7izay anjjintto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Xoossa Isreele Kaattay anjjintto!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:13">yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14-15"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:14-15">«Xiyone katamas, yashittippe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">Yeezako, ne Kaatay hare na7al afa bettii yi7iza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:14-15">giinttintteezay garkk Yesuusa hare na7a dengii eza toggeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Yesuusa tamaaritay yeya tiin akaakekaya. Zin Yesuusa bonchchinttezaypp guye unttii yeya ubba akaakeeza. Yeyi ubbay geeshsha Maxaafay geezay gark haneeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Yesuusa Alaazara duufoppi xeegii, yhayiqoppi dentheez wode ezar yez gaame asay Yesuusa oosa markkatteeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Gaame asay eza mokkodayis kezeezay, E ye mallita ootheezana si7eez gishshosii. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Yey gishos, Ferisaawe asay pettay peetayiko, «Nu abkka oothodayis danda7ooza bo7oytta; woya ubbay eza kaalliza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Paaziqa bonchchiza gallas goynnodayis Yerusalaame yhanigeezitay gancce pettii pettii Girike asay yeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Unttii Galila biitta Beetesayda katamapi ye7eez Filphoosakko yhanigii, «Godayyo, nuunii Yesuusa be7adayis koyiza» yeegii woosseeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filphoosa yhanigii Indiraases odin nam7itay yhanigii, Yesuusas odeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Asi Na7ay, bonchchinttiza wode helleeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; pettii gistte aafe biitta gancce wodhdhii wooqqekka attiko fa aaddas attiza. Zin ye gistte aafay wooqqiko gaame aafe aafiza. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Fa shemppo qadhdhiza oonkka dhabisiza; fa shemppo yha alamayid ixxiza oonkka medhinas de7os nagisiza. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Taanii yeza aqo taar yezod garkk taasi oothodayis koyiz oonkka tana kaallodayis beeziza. Taas oothiza oonakka ta Aday bonchchoda.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa yhayiqo bagga tiinatii odeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>«Yhatti ta shemppay gaame un77initeeza; yeezin waago? ‹Ta Adayyo, tana yha saataypp ashshooyee› yeego? Wa77a, taanii ye7eezay meto ekkodayisii. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Ta Adayyo, ne suntha bonchchoba» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Yeypp guye salopp, «Taanii ta suntha bonchcheeza; gujjika bonchchoda» yeegizi qaala ye7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Ye aqayid eqqeez gaame asay ye qaala si7ii, «Yeyi dada» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:29">Yhankkitay ma, «Kiitanchchay eesi odeeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yesuusa mahii unttiko, «Yha qaalay yi gishos ye7eezaypp attin ta gishos baaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Yha alamay pirddinttiza woday yhatte; yha alama aqisizana yhatti bale oloda. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Ma taanii sa7app dhoqqi geez wode asi ubba taako ko7oda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>E yeya geezay ab garkk yhayiqo yhayqqodazako unttis erisodayisii.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Gaame asay mahii, «Nu higgay Kiristtoosa medhinas yezana odiza. Yeezin, neenii waagii, As Na7ay dhoqi goddayis beeziza gee? E, As Na7ay oonoo?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesuusa, «Poo7ay yinttar xiqqa wode gam7oda. Yinttis dhumaam garkk poo7o yezin, poo7ayir yedhdhoytta. Dhumar yedhdhiz as ana yhanigizako erooya. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Poo7o na7ita maaqqad garkk poo7o yezin poo7ana ammanoytta» yeegeeza. Yesuusa yeya odeezayp guye yhanggii unttapp geemmeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihuditay ammanekaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>E yey garkk mallita u tiinayid oothinkka ammanekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Nabe Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Godayyo, nu markketithi oonii ammaneennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Goday wolqqay oossi beentteennee?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:38">Geezay tuma maaqqaday garkk unttii eza ammanekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39-40"/>Maakka Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:39-40">«U aafay be7aam garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">u wozinay akaakam garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">unttii Xoossiko maaqqin, E unttan pathaamay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">Xoossay u aafa too7iseeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:39-40">U wozina miintheeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:39-40">geez gishos unttii ammanodayis danda7ekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 12:39-40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isayaasa yeya geezay, Yesuusa bonchcho be7eez gishonnee ebaz odeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Maaqqikokka, Ayihuditay halaqitayppekka gaamitay Yesuusana ammaneeza. Zin Ferisaawe asitay fana Ayihuditay Woosa keethap kessiza gi yashitteez gishos ammaneez gi geesha markkattekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Yeya unttii ootheezay, Xoossar erinttodaypp aathii asar erinttodana doseez gishshosi.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesuusa fa qaala dhoqi uddii, «Tana ammaniza oonkka tana azazeezanakka ammaneezaypp attin tana aadda ammanooya. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Tana bi7iza oonkka tana azazeezanakka bi7iza. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Tana ammaniza ubbay dhuma gancce yezaam garkk poo7o maaqqii alame taanii ye7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Ta qaala si7ii kiitinttoowa oonakka taanii pirddaamii. Abis giiko, taanii alame ashshodayis ye7eezaypp attin pirddodayis ye7ekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Tana ixxizannee ta qaala ekkowa oonakka pirddizay yeza. Taanii odeez qaalay wurssith gallas ye atha pirddoda. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Abis giiko, taanii yeya taapp odekkaya, zin tana kiitteez ta Aday taanii ab godazakonne ab ododazako azazeeza. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Ma e kiitay medhinas de7o maaqqizana taanii eriza. Yeyi gishos, taanii odizay ta Aday tana odoba geezana» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa tamaaritay toka meecceeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Paaziqa bonchchiza gallasay hellodaypp tiinatii yha alame ashshii Adayiko yhanigiza wode helleezana Yesuusa ereeza. Yha alamayid yez faasita ubba wode doseez; folo siiqorakka unttan doseeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesuusara e tamaaritayir wolla kaho maadar Xalahe Simoona na7a Asiqoroto Yihuda Yesuusa aathii immadaygarkk e wozina gancce iita qofa gaddeeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yesuusas Aday ubba baz e kushe gaddeezana, E Xoossapp ye7eezanannee maaqqii eziko yhammadana ereeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Yesuusa kaho mi denddii fa guulantta qaarii gaddii, pooxa fa xeessa dancceeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Yeypp guye, gabate gancce haath qoli, fa tamaaritay toke meecceeza; ma fa xeessayida dancceez pooxayir ucceeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Yesuusa Simoon Phixiroosako ye7odar Phixiroosa, «Godayyo, ne ta toka meeccodee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesuusa mahii eziko, «Taanii oothizana ne yhatti erooya, zin guyepp akaakoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Yeezin, Phixiroosa, «Ne ta toka ubbarakka meeccodayis danda7ooya» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesuusa eziko, «Taanii ne toke meeccekka attiko neesinnee taasi pettipetithii baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Phixiroosa Yesuusako, «Godayyo, yeezako, ta tokay aadda baazin ta kushannee ta omma meeccoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Galla meecintteez oonkka tokepp hara baz meecinttodayis beezooya; e ubbay geeshshii. Yi geeshshii, zin ubba asii geeshshii baaya» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesuusa fana aathii immad athay oonazako eriza gishos «Yi ubbitay geeshshii baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>U toke meecceezaypp guye Yesuusa fa afila mahii ma77eeza. Maaqqii munttal afa bettii unttiko, «Taanii yinttis ootheezana akaakinee? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Yi tana asitamaarennee Goda giza; taanii yi giza maaqqeez gishos lo77o geeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Taanii yinttis Godanne asitamaare maaqqitar yi toke meecciko yinttikka pettay pettayis yhay garkk oothodayis beeziza. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Yikkee, taanii yinttis ootheezay garkk yinttikka oothod garkk yinttis aaziso maaqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; ayllay fa godaypp, kiitintteezay kiitteezaypp aadhooya. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Yi yeya erii oothizabaz maaqqiko anjjintteezita.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>«Taanii yinttan ubbita gooya; taanii maraxeezita ta eriza. Zin geeshsha Maxaafayid, ‹Taapp meezay taal afa fa toka dentheeza› ginttinttizay tuma maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Taanii Tana maaqqeezana yi ammanod garkk yeyi hanodaypp tiinattii yinttis odiza. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; taanii kiitteez oonakka mokkiza athay tana mokkiza. Tana mokkiz oonkka tana azazeezana mokkiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fana aathii immaday oonazako tiinattii odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat. 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar. 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luq. 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesuusa yeya odeezaypp guye fa wozinar gaame un77inttii, «Taanii yinttis turo odiza; tana yinttipp pettay aathii immada» gi qonccisii odeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>E o bagga odizako e tamaaritayis erinttaam ixxin pettay petta be7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>E tamaaritaypp pettay, Yesuus dosizay, Yesuusa kale betteeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Yeyi gishos, Simoon Phixiroosa eza qami7ottii, «E oona gizako an oyicoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Yeyi gishos, ye tamaaray Yesuusako haye kale shiiqii, «Godayyo, E oonoo?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii soollo dushii barssizaya» yeegeeza. Ma soollo duuthii ekkii, dushii, Simoona na7a Asiqoroto Yihuda barsseeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yihudana soollo baareezaypp guye Xalahe ellisii Yihuda gancce geleeza. Yesuusa eeko, «Ne oothodayis qoppeezanno ellisii oothoba» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Zin munttal afa betteezitaypp oonkka Yesuusa yeya abis geezako erekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yihuda miishe aykkizi gishos e tamaaritaypp pettay pettay Yesuusa e, «Paaziqa bonchchiza gallasis paasi koshshiza baz wonggoba woy manqqitayis muxaata inggoba geeza» yeegii qoppeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yihuda soollo baareezangarkk izira bale kezeeza. Ye wode sa7a qamma.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Orothi kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yihuda bale kezeezaypp guye, Yesuusa, «Yhatti As Na7ay bonchchintteeza; Xoossaykka e baggar bonchchintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Xoossay e baggar bonchchinttiko E fa ommas As Na7a bonchchoda; ma E yeya ellis oothoda. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Ta na7untho, taanii yinttar gaame wode gam7aamii. Yi tana koyoda, zin taanii Ayihuditayis odeezan garkk, ‹Yi taanii yhanigiza aqo yhammadayis danda7ooya› <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Taanii yinttis inggiz orothi kiitay yhaya; pettay petta qadhdhoytta. Taanii yinttan qadhdheezay garkk yi pettay petta qadhdhodayis beeziza. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Yi pettay pettayira dosinttiko yi ta tamaare maaqqizana asii ubbay eroda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa kaddodana Yesuusa tiinattii odeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luq. 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simoon Phixiroosa Yesuusako, «Godayyo, ne ana yhanigee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii yhanigiza aqo neenii yhatti kaallodayis danda7ooya, zin guyepp tana kaalloda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Phixiroosa, «Godayyo, taanii nena yhatti kaallodayis abis danda7oosa? Taanii ne gishos yhayqqodayis giig betteeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Ta gishos yhayqqodayis tuma giig betteennee? Taanii nees turo odiza; shugula uukkodaypp tiini neenii tana hayidzii tok kaddoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Adayko kanggiza oge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaritayiko, «Yi wozinay un77inttipe, Xooss ammanoytta, tanakka ammanoytta. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Ta Aday kara gaame aqo yeza. Taanii yinttis bessi giigisodayis yhanigiza. Yeya maaqqekkazako taanii yinttis ododizin. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Taanii yhanigii bessi giigiseezaypp guye taanii yeza aqo yi yezod garkk maaqqii yi7ii yinttan taako kanggoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Yi taanii yhanigiza aqo kanggiz oge yi eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Yeezin, Toomaasa, «Godayyo, neenii yhanigiza aqo nuunii erooya; oga wayizii erodayis danda7odee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Oge, tumaynnee de7o tana. Ta baggar maaqqaam ixxiko oonkka ta Adayko yhammadayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Yi tana eriza baz maaqqeezako, ta Adakka eroda. Zin yhaypp aykkii yi eza erizanee eza be77eeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filphoosa Yesuusako, «Godayyo, Ada nuna beezoba; yeyi nuus gidoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii yhaygarkk wode yinttar yeezinka tana eroosa? Tana be7eez athay Adakka be7eeza. Yeezin, neenii waagii, ‹Ada nuna beezooyee› gee? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Taanii Adayir yezannee Adaykka taar yezana neenii ammanoosannee? Taanii yinttis odiz qaala taanii taapp odooya, zin taar yeza Aday fa ootho oothiza. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Taanii Adayir yezanannee Adaykka taar yezana yi ammanoytta. Yeya ammanaamixiko ta ootheez malla bazitayil tana ammanoytta.<verse eid="JHN 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>«Taanii yinttis turo odiza; tana ammaniza athay taanii oothiza ooso oothod. Taanii Adayko yhanigiza gishos tana ammaniza oonkka yhaypp aadhiz oosita oothoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Aday Na7ay baggar bonchchnttod garkk ta sunthar yi woossiza ubbita ta yinttis oothoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Ta sunthar ababazikka yi oyiciko ta yinttis oothoda.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa geeshsha Ayyana immadayis qaala geleeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Yi tana qadhiko ta kiita naagoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Taanii Ada woossoda; yinttar medhinas yezod garkk minthathiza yinttis immada. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Yha alame asay eza be7ekkazay gishonnee eroowa gishos eza ekkodayis danda7ooya tuma Ayyana. Zin E yinttar yeza gishonnee yi gancce yezod gishos yi eza eroda.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>«Taanii yinttan inda ade baa na7a garkk yi aadda ashshaamii; maaqqii yinttiko ye7oda. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Xiqqa wodepp guye alamay tana mahii be7enna, zin yi be7ada. Taanii de7or yeza gishos yinttikka de7or yessada. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Taanii ta Adayir, yi taar, ma taanii yinttar yezana yi ye gallas eroda.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>«Ta kiita ekkii naagizay tana qaadhiza. Tana qadhdhizana ta Adaykka qaadhiza; taankka eza qadhdhiza; taanii eesi benttoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Asiqoroto Yihuda baa yhankko Yihuda Yesuusako, «Godayyo, neenii wayizii alamayis baazin nuus nena beezodee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Tana qadhdhiza oonkka ta qaalayis kiittinttoda. Ta Aday eza qadhdhoda. Ma ta Adayira taara eziko yi7ii ezar yezoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Tana dosowa oonkka ta qaalayis kiittinttooya. Yi si7iz qaalay tana kiitteez Aday bazapp attin tabaz baaya.»<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«Taanii yinttar yhatti yezar yeya yinttis odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Zin Aday ta sunthar kiittoda minthathiza geesha Ayyanay, yinttan ubba baz tamarssoda. Taanii yinttis odeez ubba E yinttan hassayisoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>Sarotithi yinttis ashshoda. Taanii ta sarotitha yinttis immada. Ta ingiz sarotithay alamay inggiz sarotithay garkk baaya. Yeyi gishos, un77intippete, yashittipate.<verse eid="JHN 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>«Taanii yhammad, maaqqii yinttiko ye7oda» geezana yi si7eeza. Yi tana tuma dosizibaz maaqqeezako ta Aday taapp aadhiz gishos taanii eziko yhanigizayid yi ufayttoda. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Yeyi hanodar yi ammanod garkk yeyi hanekkazin tiinatii taanii yinttis odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Yha alama aqisizay yi7iza gishos yhaypp guye yinttar gaame odinttaamii. Tana E abikka oothodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Zin taanii Ada qadhdhizana alamay erod garkk ta Aday tana azazeezana ubba oothiza. Dendoytta; yhaypp wolla yhammada.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Woynnee turas ubbay Yesuusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>«Taanii woynnes tuma ubba. Oothizay ta Ada. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Taal afa yezii aafe aafowa shaqo ubba E kariza. Aafiz shaqo tiinaasaypp aadhii aafoday garkk ye shaqa E giigisoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Taanii yinttis odeez qaalay gishos yi geeshshita. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Taar yezoytta; taankka yinttar yezoda. Woynnee shaqay ubbayir yezekka attiko ye shaqay fa aaddas aafe aafodayis danda7ooya. Yey garkkekka, yinttikka taal yezekka attiko aafe aafodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«Taanii woynnes ubba; yi shaqqita. Taar yezizaynnee taanii ezar yezizay, E gaame aafe aafoda. Ta baazin yi yi ubbas abikka oothodayis danda7ooya. <figure style="fig" alt="Grape vine on trellis" file="HK00112B.tif" size="span" ref="15:5">Woyne mithinnee I aafe</figure> <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Taar yezoowazay shaqo garkk bale olinttii meloda. Unttan shiishii tama oloda, eexoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Yi taar yeziko, ta qaalaykka yinttar yeziko, yi koyiz baz abi maaqqikokka woossoytta; yi ekkoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Yi gaame aafe aafikonne ta tamaare maaqqiko, yeyid ta Aday bonchchnttoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Aday tana qadhdhizay garkk taankka yinttan qadhdhiza; ta siiqayir yezoytta. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Taanii ta Aday kiita naagii e siiqayid yezeezay mgarkk yinttikka ta kiita naagiko ta siiqayid yezoda.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>«Ta ufayssay yinttar maaqqaday garkkennee yi ufayssay folo maaqqad garkk taanii yinttis yeya odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ta kiitay yhaya; taanii yinttan qadhdheezay garkk yinttikka woli woli qadhdhoytta. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Fa shemppo fa laggayis aathii inggizaypp aadhiz dama siiqo baaya. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Taanii yinttan kiitteez ubbita yi oothiko yi ta dabbita.<verse eid="JHN 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>«Aylle fa goday oothizabaz eroowa gishos taanii yinttan yhaypp guye ayllita gamii. Zin ta Adaypp si7eez ubbita taanii yinttis odeez gishos yinttan dosintteezita geeza. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Taanii yinttan doreezaypp attin yi tana doorekkaya. Yi yhanigii dhaboowa aafe aafod garkk taanii yinttan shuumeeza. Yeezako ta Aday yi ta sunthar woosseezibaz ubba yinttis immada. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Ta kiitay yhaya: woli woli qadhdhoytta.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa alamay E tamaaritana ixxodana odeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Alamay yinttan ixxiko tiinattii tana ixxeeza eroytta. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Yi alame baz maaqqeezako alamay fabaz garkk yinttan qadhdhoda. Zin taanii yinttan alamepp shagii dooreez gishonnee yi alame baz baa gishos alamay yinttan ixxiza. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>‹Aylle fa godaypp aadhooya› gi taanii yinttis odeezana qoppoytta. Unttii tana bayi7eez baz maaqqiko yinttanakka bayi7oda. Unttii ta qaala naageezbaz maaqqiko yi qaalakka naagoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Zin unttii tana azazeezana eroowa gishos yha ubba ta baggar yinttal afa oothoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Taanii yi7ii odekkabaz maaqqeezako unttisi nagara maaqqenna. Zin yhatti unttii ootheez nagarayis odod salambe baaya. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Tana ixxizay ta Adakka ixxiza. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Oonkka oothekka ooso ta u gancce oothibe7ekkabaz maaqqeezako unttis nagara maaqqaam zin yhatti unttii taanii ootheeza bi7ii tanakka ta Adakka ixxeeza. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Zin u higgayid, ‹Tana cer ixxeeza› ginttinttii xaafintteezay polinttod garkk yeyi haneeza.<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>«Adaypp yi7iz tuma beeziza Ayyana ta yinttis kiittoda. E yinttan minthathoda, tabaz markkottoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Yinttikka tiinapp aykkii taar yeza gishos tabaz markkottoda.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>«Taanii yeya yi ammanay dhabaam garkk yinttis odeeza. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>U yinttan Ayihuditay Woosa Keethitaypp kessii dakkoda. Yey garkkekka, yinttan wodhiza oonkka Xoossii koyiz baz oothiza aaziza wode ye7oda. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Unttii yeya yinttal afa oothizay tana woy Ada eroowa gishshosi. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Zin unttii yeya yinttal afa oothiza wode hellodar taanii yinttis odeezana yi akaakod garkk taanii yinttis yhaya odeeza. Tiinatii taanii yhaya yinttis odekka gam7eezay ta yinttar yeza gishshosi.<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geesha Ayyana ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>«Zin yhatti taanii tana kiitteezayiko yhanigiza; yinttapp oonkka, ‹Ana yhanigee?› gi tana oyicizay baaya. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Zin taanii yeya odeez gishos yi wozinay azzanor kumeeza. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Zin taanii yinttis turo odiza; taanii yhanigiko yinttis lo77o. Abis giiko, taanii yhanggaam ixxiko minthathizay yinttiko ye7enna. Zin taanii yhanigii eza yinttiko dakkoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Minthathizay yi7ii, nagarabazinnee, xillotith bazinnee pirdda bagga yha alame as erisoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Nagarabaggay, asay tana ammanoowa gishshosii. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Xillotithibaggay, taanii Adayko yhanigiza gishonnee yi tana maaqqii bo7oowa gishshosi. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Pirddabaggay, ma alame aqisizay pirddintteez gishshosii.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Taanii yinttis odiza gaame baz yeza, zin yhatti yinttis gelooya. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Tuma Ayyana yi7ii yinttan tumatithii ubbayko kaalithoda. E si7eez baz odizapp attin paapp ababazikka odooya. Ma tiinapp ye7odibaz yinttis E ododa. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>E taasi yezaypp ekkii yinttis odiza gishos E tana bonchchoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Adayis yeza baz ubbitay tabaz; ‹Ayyanay taasi yezaypp ekkii yinttis ododa› taanii geezay yey gishosii.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yi azzanay ufayisar laaminttoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Xiqqa wodepp guye yi tana be7aamii; maakka xiqqa wodepp guye yi tana be7ada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>E tamaaritaypp pettay pettay woli gancce, «Xiqqa wodeppi guye yi tana be7aamii; ma xiqqa wodepp guye yi tana be7ada; maakka taanii Adayko yhanigiza guussay waaguusso?» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>«Xiqqa wodepp guye waaguusso? E abi odinttizako nuus erinttooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Unttii fana oyicodayis koyizana Yesuusa erii, «Taanii, ‹Xiqqa wodeppi guye yi tana be7aamii; ma xiqqa wodepp guye yi tana be7ada› yeegeez gisho yi woli woli oyicinee? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yi yeekkodannee afuxoda, zin yha alamay ufayttoda. Yhatti yi azzanoda, zin yi azzanay ufayisa laaminttoda. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Wodeth asita na7a yelod hanodar fa yelo woday helleez gishos hirigiza. Zin na7a yelleezaypp guye na7a yha alamayil yelintteezay ufayssiza gishos fa meta iza dogiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Yey garkk, yinttikka yi wozinar azaniza, zin taanii yinttan maaqqii be7ada. Yi wozinay lo7ithii ufayttoda; ye ufayssa oonkka yinttapp ekkenna.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>«Ye gallas yi tana ababazikka woosseenaa. Taanii yinttis turo odiza; yi ta sunthar woossiza baz ubba Aday yinttis immada. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Yhanno hellodayis ta sunthar ababazkka yi woossekkaya. Yi ufayssay folo maaqqad garkk Xoossa woossoytta; yi ekkoda.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Taanii yhanno hellodayis yinttis aazisor odeeza, yhaypp taanii aazisor odoowa wode ye7oda. Zin Adayibagga taanii yinttis qoncissii ododa. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Ye gallas yi ta sunthar Ada woossoda; yi gishos taanii Ada woossaamii. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Abis giiko, Aday fa ubbas yinttan qadhdhiza. Yi tana qadhdhiza gishonnee taanii Aday lanqqepp ye7eezana yi ammaneez gishos E yinttan qaadhiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Taanii Aday lanqqepp yha alame ye7eeza; ma alame ashshii Adayko yhammada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>E tamaaritay maaqqii, «Yeezako, yhatti neenii qoncce odiza; aazisor abikka odooya. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Neenii ubba baz erizana nuunii yhatti eriza; ma nena oonkka oyicod garkk neenii koyooya. Yeyi nuna neenii Xoossapp kiitintteez as maaqqeezay ammanthiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yeezin, Yesuusa mahii unttiko, «Yhatti ammaninnee? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Yeezako, yi, yi kara laalinttiz wodaynnee ta ubbas olii ashii qosinttiza woday ye7oda; yhattekka yi7ii helleeza. Zin Aday taar yeza gishos ta ta aadda baaya. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Yi taar yeziko saro yinttis yezoday garkk taanii yeya odeeza. Alamel yezitar yi metinttoda. Zin miinggoytta; taanii alama gameeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesuusa yeya odeezaypp guye pude salo bi7ii, yhay garkk yeegeeza: «Adayyo, saatay helleeza; ne Na7ay nena bonchchod garkk neenii ne Na7a bonchchoba. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Neenii ezis inggeez ubbayis E medhinas de7o immadaygarkk as ubbayil afa ezisi mawute inggeeza. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Medhina de7o, nena, pettii tuma Xoossannee ne kiitteez Yesuus Kiristtoosa ero. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Ne ta oothod garkk inggeez oosa polii nena sa7all bonchcheeza. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Yhattekka, Adayyo, alame medhinttodaypp tiina ne kale taas yez bonchchayir tana bonchchoba.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>«Alame asaypp neenii taasi inggeezita nena eriseeza. Unttii neesita; neenii unttan taas inggeeza. Unttii ne qaalayiskka kiittintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Neenii taasi inggeez ubba baz neeppi ye7eezana unttii yhatti eriza. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Neenii taasi inggeez qaala taanii unttis inggeeza; unttikka ye qaala ekkeeza. Taanii ne lanqqepp ye7eezay tuma maaqqizana erii neenii tana azazeezanakka ammaneeza.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>«Taanii unttis woossiza. U neesita maaqqeez gishos neenii taas inggeez asayis woossizaypp attin alamayis woossaamii. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Taas yeza ubbabazay nebaz; nees yez ubbitaykka tabaz. Taanii u baggar bonchchintteeza. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Taanii yhaypp guye alamel yezaamii; unttii alamel yeza. Taanii yhatti neeko yhanigiza. Geeshsh Adayyo, yha neenii taas inggeezitay neerannee taara petto maaqqeezaygarkk unttii petto maaqqad garkk unttan ne taas inggeez ne sunthayir naagoba. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Taanii unttar sa7all yezar, ne taas inggeez ne sunthay wolqqar unttan naageeza. Geeshsha Maxaafay geezay polinttod garkk dhabodayis beeziza athaypp attin unttapp hara oonkka dhabekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>«Yhatti ta neeko yhanigiza. Ta ufayssay u wozina gancce folo maaqqad garkk yhaya taanii alamel yezar odiza. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Taanii unttis ne qaala inggeeza. Taanii alamepp maaqqekkazay garkk, unttikka alamepp maaqqekka gishos alame unttan ixxeeza. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Neenii iitapp unttan naagod garkkepp attin alamepp kessod garkk woossaamii. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Taanii alamepp maaqqekkazay garkk unttikka alamepp baaya. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Neenii ne tumatithar unttan nebaz oothoba; ne qaalaykka tuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Neenii tana alame kiitteezay garkk taankka unttan alame azazeeza. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Ma unttii tuma geeshsh maaqqad garkk taanii ta ubba u gishos tana ta geeshsh udiza.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Taanii u aaddas baazin unttii qaala odin, tana ammanod asitayiskka woossiza. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Unttii ubbitay petto maaqqad garkk taanii woossiza. Adayyo, ne taar yezay garkk, ma ta neer yezay garkk unttii nuur yezod garkk woossiza. Ye wode neennee tannee azazeezana alamay ammanoda. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Neenne taanii petto maaqqeezay garkk, unttii petto maaqqad garkk, neenii tana bonchcheezay garkk, taankka unttan bonchcheeza. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Taanii u gancce, neenii taar yezay garkk unttii folo petto maaqqad garkk nena woossiza. Yeykka, ne tana kiitteezanannee ne tana qadhdheez qadhayir unttan qadhdheezana alame erod garkke.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«Adayyo, neenii taas inggeezitay taanii yeza aqo taar yezoday garkk koyiza. Alamay medhinttodaypp tiina neenii tana qadhdheez gishos taas inggeez ta bonchcha unttii be7ada.<verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>«Geeshshi Adayyo, alame nena erooya, zin taan nena eriza. Ma neenii tana azazeezana yhayttitay eriza. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Neenii tana siiqeez siiqqay unttar yezod garkk, ma taanii unttar maaqqad garkk, taanii ne suntha unttan eriseeza; tiinaskka erisoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa aykinttith</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luq. 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesuusa woosa wuurissezayppi guye fa tamaaritayir Qediroona loophpha piinggii, ye bessayid yez woyra gade gancce geleeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yesuusa gaame wode fa tamaaritayir ezayid shiiqiza gishos Yesuusa aathii inggeez Yihuda ye aqat eriza. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Yeyi gishos, Yihuda paanoose, zhabbe, toorarannee gonddallera aykkeez gaame wotaaddarita, qeese halaqitayinnee Ferisaawe asay kiitteez Xoossa Keethi naagiz poolisita kaalethi ekkii, ye aqo yhanigeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesuusa fana hellod haniza baz ubba erii, gaxa kezii, «Oona koyee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Unttii mahii, «Naazirete Yesuusa koyiza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">E mahii, «Tana» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesuusa aathii inggeez Yihuda ezayid unttar eqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>E, «Tana» geez wode unttii guye shiiqii, fokkeeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesuusa maakka, «Oona koyinnee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Unttii, «Naazirete Yesuusa koyiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>E mahii, «Tana maaqqizana yinttis odeeza. Yikkee, yi tana koyiz baz maaqqeeko yhayttita dakkoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>E yeya geezay, «Adayyo, neenii taasi inggezitaypp hara attozin pettaka dhabisekka» geez qaalay polinttod garkke.<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simoon Phixiroosas fa mashsha yeza mashsha shoddii qeese halaqa ayllayis ushachchi haytto, qadhi oleeza. Ye ayllay sunthay Malkkoosa. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yesuusa Phixiroosako, «Ne mashsha shookayid mahoba. Ta Aday taasi inggeez xuu7aypp ta uzhaama neesi aazinee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa qeesitay tiina shiiqeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luq. 22:54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Ayihude wotaaddaritayir u halaqay Xoossa Keethi naagiz poolisitayira wolla Yesuusa aykkii acceeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Tiina Yesuusana Haannako kanggeeza. Haanna ye laythi qeese halaqa maaqqiz Qayyaafa bolle. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Qayyaafa, «Asii woya gishos pettii asii yhayqqiko lo77o» gi tiina Ayihuditana zoreezaya.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa Yesuusana kaddeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat. 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar. 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luq. 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simoon Phixiroosannee hara pettii tamaaray Yesuusa kaallii qitteeza. Qeese halaqay ye yhankko tamaara lo7ithii eriza. Yeyi gishos, E Yesuusar qeese halaqay zabba geleeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Zin Phixiroosa baler gase pengel eqqeeza. Qeese halaqay eriza hara tamaaray bale kezii, penge naagiza asttis odin, Phixiroosa gelisseeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Penge naagiz asita Phixiroosako, «Neenii, ye athay tamaaritaypp petta baasa?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Phixiroosa mahii, «Wa77a, tana baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Sa7ay meeggiza gishos ayllitayirannee naagizitay xiife tama eethii, marii eqqii kazhiza. Pheixiroosakka unttar eqqii tama kazhiza.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeese halaqay Yesuusana oyiceeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luq. 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Qeese halaqay Yesuusa, e tamaaritay baggannee e timirttay bagga oyceeza. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii asi ubbas geesha odeeza. Taanii Ayihude ubbitay shiiqiza Ayihuditay Woosa Keetha giddonnee Xoossa Keetha ubba wode taamarsseeza. Geema abikka odekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Yeezin, neenii tana abis oyicce? Ta ododar si7eez asa oyccoba. Ye asay taanii odeezana eriza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesuusa yeya geez wode ye bessayid eqqeez wotaaddaritaypp pettay Yesuusa baqqii, «Qeese halaqayis yhay garkk yeegii mahinnee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesuusa mahii, «Taanii iitta baz odintteez maaqqiko markka ko7oba. Zin taanii turo odintteez maaqqiko tana abis baqqee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Yeyi gishos, Haanna, Yesuusa aciniteezan garkk qeese halaqa Qayyaafako dakkeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phixiroosa Yesuusana kaddeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat. 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar. 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luq. 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Phixiroosa ezayid eqqii, tama kazhodar, atteez asay eziko, «Neenii yha athay tamaaritaypp petta baasa?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Phixiroosa mahii, «Wa77a, taanii e tamaare baaya» yeegii kaddeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Qeese halaqay ayllitayippe pettay, Phixiroosa haya gacheez athay dabbay, Phixiroosako, «Taanii nena ezar atakilittay gancce be7ekkasanee?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Phixiroosa maakka kaddeeza. E yeya geezan garkk shugula uukkeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:38">Wan. 13:38</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luq. 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Wontta guura, unttii Yesuusana Qayyaafa karapp gade aqisizay ooso keetha kanggeeza. Ayihuditay Paaziqa Baale katha maadayis fana tunisaamay garkk gade aqisizay ooso keetha gelekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Yeyi gishos, Philaaxoosa unttiko bale kezii, «Yha atha abis mootee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Unttii, «E iita oothekkabaz maaqqeezako nuunii eza neeko ke7aamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Philaaxoosa mahii, «Yi eza ekkii kanggii, yi higgay gizay garkk ezal afa pirddoytta» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayihuditay, «Oonakka wodhiza mawute nuus baaya» yeegeeza; <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Yeyi haneezay Yesuusa abigarkk yhayiqo yhayqqodazako erisodayis odeez qaalay polinttodayisii.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Philaaxoosa fa ooso keetha maaqqii gelii, Yesuusa xeegii, «Neenii Ayihude kaato?» yeegii oyceeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesuusa Philaaxoosako, «Yha oyicha neenii neepp oyicinennee woy hara asii nees tabaz odeennee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Philaaxoosa mahii, «Ta Ayihude aso? Ne asayira qeese halaqitay nena taasi aathii inggeeza. Ne abi ootheenee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesuusa, «Ta kaatetithay yha alamayid baaya. E yhaydda maaqqeezako ta Ayihuditay halaqitayis aadhii ingginttod garkk ta ayllitay taasi olinttoda. Zin ta kaatetithay yha alamayid baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Yeyi gishos, Philaaxoosa Yesuusako, «Yeezin, neenii kaatonnee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesuusa mahii, «Tuma ta kaate maaqqizana ne geeza. Taanii yelintteezaynnee yha alame ye7eezay tumatithis markkattodayis. Tuma bagga maaqqeez oonkka taanii giza si7iza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Philaaxoosa, «Tuma aba bazo?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Philaaxoosa yeya geezaypp guye Ayihuditayiko bale kezii, «Taanii eepp aba iitakka denggekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Zin Paaziqa Baale gallas, pettii asii yinttis achchapp bili7iz woga yeza. Taanii yinttis Ayihuditay kaata billod garkk koyinnee?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Unttii mahii, fa qaala dhoqi udii, «Baribaana billobapp attin eza baaya» yeegeeza. Zin Baribaana paanno.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa sottinttodaygarkke pirddeeza.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Mat. 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar. 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Yeypp guye, Philaaxoosa Yesuusana garafiseeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Wotaaddaritay anggunthi zawude medhdhii e ommayil gaddeeza. Ma zoqo afila eza ma7iseeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Eziko shiiqii, «Ayihude kaatayyo, medhinas kawutoba» yeegii eza baqqeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Philaaxoosa maakka bale kezii, Ayihuditayiko, «Yeezako, taanii eepp aba iitakka denggekaaza yi erod garkk eza yinttiko bale kessoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa anggunthi zawude fa ommal gaddii, zoqo afila ma77ii, bale kezeeza. Philaaxoosa Ayihuditayiko, «Atha yhaya bo7oytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Qeese halaqitayinnee Xoossa Keethi naagizitay eza be7eez wode fa qaala dhoqi uddii, «Mazqalel afa sottoba! sottoba!» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Philaaxoosa unttiko, «Yi eza kanggii, mazqalel afa sottoytta. Taanii eepp aba iitakka denggekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ayihuditay mahii, «Nuus higgay yeza. E fana Xooss na7a ootheez gishos nu higgay garkk E yhayqqodayis beeziza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Philaaxoosa yeya si7eez wode tiinaasaypp iita yashitteeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Maakka Philaaxoosa fa ooso keethi maaqqii gelii Yesuusako, «Neenii anapp ye7eenee?» yeegii oyceeza. Zin Yesuusa ezisi abikka mahekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Yeyi gishos, Philaaxoosa, «Taas odoosa? Nena billodayis woy mazqalel afa sottodayis taasi mawute yezana eroosa?» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesuusa, «Xoossay nees silixannee inggekkabaz maaqqeezako taal afa silixxaanee nees baabonazin. Yeyi gishos, tana nees aathii inggeezay aadhiz nagara ootheeza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat. 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar. 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luq. 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Philaaxoosa yeya si7eez wode Yesuusa billodayis oge koyeeza. Zin Ayihuditay fa qaala dhoqi uddii, «Neenii eza billizbaz maaqqiko Kaattay Qeesare bagga baaya. Fana kaate giz oonkka Qeesaares morkke» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Philaaxoosa yeya si7ii Yesuusa bale kesseeza. Yeezii, «Lochche Shuchchi» yeegiz bees pirdde oydel betteeza. Ibraysxe qaalayir ye aqay «Gebeta» guussii. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Ye gallasay Paaziqa Baale bonchchodayis giigintto gallas. Ye wode sa7a usuppun saate heera. Philaaxoosa Ayihuditayiko, «Yi kaata yhaya bo7oytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Ayihuditay fa qaala dhoqi udii, «Dhabisoba! Dhabisoba! Mazqalel afa sottoba» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Philaaxoosa mahii, «Yi kaata taanii mazqalel afa sottodayis koyinee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Qeese halaqitay, «Qeesarepp hara kaati nuus baaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Yeypp guye, unttii Yesuusa mazqalel afa sottod garkk Philaaxoosa unttis aathii inggeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Unttii Yesuusa aykkii kanggeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa sotintta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luq. 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yesuusa fa mazqala tookkii, «Omma ota» giz aqo yhanigeeza. «Omma ota» guussay Ibrayisxe qaalayir «Golggotta» guusii. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Unttii ye aqayid mazqalel afa Yesuusa sotteeza. Ma ezar hara nam7i asita, petta gede baggar yhankka yhana baggar mazqalel afa sotteeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Philaaxoosa, «Ayihuditay Kaati, Naazirete Yesuusa» yeegizi xuufe xaaffii mazqalel afa gaddeeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yesuusa mazqalel afa sotintteez aqay katamas kale yez gishos gaame Ayihuditay ye xuufa nabbabeeza. Xuufay xaafintteezay Ibrayisxxe doonar, Laatinee doonarannee Girike doonara. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Yeyi gishos, qeese halaqitay Philaaxoosako, «‹Yha athay fana Ayihude kaati yeegeeza› gi xaafobapp attin ‹Ayihude kaati› gi xaafippe» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Yeezin, Philaaxoosa, «Ta xaafeezana xaafeeza» yeegii maheeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Wotaaddaritay mazqalel afa eza sotteezaypp guye e afila ekkii, oyddii aqo wolla qoo7inttii, petto petto ekkeeza. E afar olii ma77iza adusse afila ekkeeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Wotaaddaritay, «Oona hellodazako, ixxa olodaypp attin afila per7aamii» yeegeeza. Yeyi haneezay geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Ta afila shaakkii ekkeeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ta adusse afila gujjikka ixxa oleeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">ginttinttizay polinttodgarkke. Yeyi gishos, wotaadderitay yeya ootheeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Zin Yesuusa mazqale kale e indat, e indat mishshiti, Qeliyoophe machchat Mayiramira Magdeela Mayrama eqqeeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesuusa fa indatinnee E qaadhiza tamaaray ezayid eqqeezita bi7ii, fa indatiko, «Ta indatee, ne na7a yhaya bo7oba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Yeypp guye, ye tamaarayiko, «Ne inidat yhanno bo7oba» yeegeeza. Ye tamaaray izo ye wodepp aykkii fa kara kanggeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yhayqqeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luq. 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa ubbay yhatti polintteezana erii, geeshsha Maxaafayid xaafintteezay polinttod garkk «Tana saamiza» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Ye aqayid pettii xugga kunithi caala woyne yeza. Unttii zanza ye woynayid olii, hisophe mithii xeeral gaddii, Yesuusa doonayiko shiisheeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesuusa woyna ganxxii bi7ii, «Polintteeza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Yeypp guye, fa morga ziqqi udii fa shemppa inggeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa miyya toorar caddeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Ye gallas giigintto gallas maaqqiz gishonnee wonttitha gallasay bonchcho maala maaqqiz gishos asay ahay mazqalel afa maala gallas peezhaamgarkk unttan toka menithii, mazqalaypp wodhisoday garkk Ayihuditay Philaaxoosa woosseeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Yeyi gishos, wotaaddaritay yhanigii, Yesuusar sotintteez nam7i asay toka mentheeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Zin Yesuusako ye7eez wode E yhayqqeeza bi7ii, e toka menthekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Zin wotaaddaritaypp pettay Ea miyya toorar caddin elle suuthinnee haathii goggeeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Yi ammanod garkk yeya be7eezay markkatteeza. E markkatithaykka tuma. Ma yeypp E oosa odizay tuma maaqqeeza eriza. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Yeyi haneezay geeshsha Maxaafay, «E meqethitaypp pettii bazikka meqqenna» geezay polinttod garkke. <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Maakka geeshsha Maxaafay hara aqa, «Unttikka fa caddeezana be7ada» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa moogintteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luq. 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Yeypp guye, Armataasa gizi katamapp ye7eez Yooseefa Yesuusa aha ekkodayis Philaaxoosa woosseeza. Yooseefa Ayihuditayis yashitteez gishos qosor Yesuusa kaalliza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:38">Philaaxoosa, «Ekkoba» yeegeeza. Yeyi gishos, Yooseefa shiiqii Yesuusa aha ekkeeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Ma yeypp Niqodimoosa, yhaypp tiin Yesuusako qamma ye7eezay, karbbennee godare uuthara walakintteez pettii kilo giraame maaqqiz shitto ekkii Yooseefar wolla ye7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ye nam77ii asitay Yesuus aha ekkii, Ayihuditay aha ziidhith wogar, shittora, moogo afilar sawaxeeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Yesuusa sotintteez aqay atakiltte gade. Ye atakiltte gancce shuchchip woocintti giigeez tiina oonkka mooginttekka oroth duufay yeza. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ye duufay lanqqe yez gishonnee Ayihuditay maalas giiginttiza gallas maaqqeez gishos Yesuusa aha moogeeza.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yhayiqopp denddeeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luq. 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Ya Saaminttatis tiina gallas sa7a geezhekkazin, Magdeela Mayrama, Yesuusa moogintteez duufayiko yhanigii shuchchay ye duufay doonaypp hali7eezana be7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Simoon Phixiroosakonnee Yesuusa qadhdhiza yhankko tamaarayiko woxxii yhanigii, «Duufaypp Goda ekkii dhabeeza; eza aba gaddeezako nu erooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Yeyi gishos, Phixiroosannee yhankko tamaaray kezii duufo yhanigeeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Nam7itaykka wolla woxxeeza; zin yhankko tamaaray Phixiroosapp aadhii tiinattii duufo helleeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Ye tamaaray zuggii, moogo afila be7eeza, zin duufo gancce wodhdhekaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simoon Phixiroosa eza kaallii yi7ii, duufo wodhdhii moogo afilay ezayid yezana be7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Ma Yesuusa ommas xaaxintteez afilay dakinthinttii duma pettii aqo yezana be7eeza. Ye afilay duma yezaypp attin moogo afilayir wolla baaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Ye wode tiinattii duufo helleez yhankko tamaaray gelii bi7ii ammaneeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Yesuusa yhayiqopp denddo beezizana odiza geeshsha maxxaafe qaala unttii haga akaakekaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Yeypp guye, e tamaaritay fa kara maaqqii yhanigeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Magdeela Mayramis bentteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar. 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Zin Mayrama ye duufay doonayid eqqii yeekkittar zuggii duufay gancce be7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Boothi afila ma77eez nam77ii kiitanchchitay Yesuusa ahay woyi7eez aqayid pettay omma achchara yhankkay toke achchara betteezita be7eeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Unttii iiko, «Yhan astte, abis yeekkee?» yeegii oyiceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Iza, «Unttii ta Goda ekkii dhabeeza; unttii aba gaddeezako taanii erooya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Yeya geezaypp guye, izakka guye maaqqii be7adar Yesuusa ezayid eqqeezana be7eeza. Zin E Yesuusa maaqqeezana erekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesuusa iziko, «Yhan astte, abis yeekkee? Oona koyee?» yeegii oyceeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Mayrama atakiltte naagiza asii aazin, «Godayyo, ne ekkeezibaz maaqqiko, eza aba gaddeezako taasi odooye. Taanii eza ekkoda» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesuusa iziko, «Mayrame» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Iza eziko mahii, Ibraysxe doonar «Rebuunii» yeegeeza. Yeyis birshshithay «Asitamaarayyo» guusii.<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesuusa iziko, «Taanii haga ta Adayko yhanigekka gishos tana aykkii ashshodayis koyppe. Zin ta ishitayko yhanigii, ‹Taanii ta Adayikora yi Adayiko, ta Xoossayikora yi Xoossayiko, yhammada geeza› gi unttisi odoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Magdeela Mayrama Goda be7eezanannee izis yeya E odeezana yhanigii e tamaaritayis odeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa tamaaritayis bentteeza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luq. 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Saaminttaypp tiina gallas omarsse, e tamaaritay Ayihuditayis yashittii ibithi gorddii shiiqii betteezin, Yesuusa yi7ii, u gancce eqqii, «Saro yinttis maaqqo» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Yeya gi maaqqii fa kushannee fa miya unttan beezeeza. E tamaaritay Goda bi7ii gaame ufaytteeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesuusa mahii unttiko, «Saro yinttis maaqqo; ta Aday tana kiitteezaygarkk taankka yinttan kiittiza» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Yeya geezaypp guye, unttal afa ufi gi puggeeza. Ma, «geeshsha Ayyana ekkoytta. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Yinttii atto geez asay nagaray atto ginttinttoda. Yi atto geekkazittayis nagaray atto giinttinttaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusara Toomaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Zin taphpho nam77ii tamaaritaypp pettay, Didimoosa ginttinttiz Toomaasa, Yesuusa ye7eez wode unttar baaya. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Yeyi gishos, yhankko e tamaaritay Toomaasakko, «Nuunii Goda be7eeza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Zin Toomaasa unttiko, «Misimarer E cadintteez e kushayid yez beeta be7ekkazar ye beeta ta biradhdher bochchekazar, ma ta kusha e miyayid dakkii be7ekkazar ammanaamii» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Saaminttapp guye, Yesuusa tamaaritay maakka kara shiiqii betteeza; Toomaasakka unttar yeza. Ibithii gorddinttii yeezin Yesuusa yi7ii, u gancce eqqii, «Saro yinttis maaqqo» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa Toomaasako, «Ta kusha ne biradhdher bochchii bo7oba. Ma ne kusha ta miyayid dakkii bo7oba; sidhippe, ammanoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Toomaasa mahii, «Ta Godayyo, ta Xoossayo» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yeezin Yesuusa, «Neenii tana be7eez gishos ammaneeza, zin tana be7ekkazar ammaneezitay anjjintteezita» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yha maxaafay qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesuusa yha maxaafay gancce xaafintteez baz hara gaame malita fa tamaaritay tiina ootheeza. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Zin Yesuusa E Kiristtoosa, Xoossa Na7a maaqqizana yi ammanod garkk ammanii e sunthayir de7o demmaday garkk yhayi xaafintteeza.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa laappun fa tamaaritayis bentteeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Yeypp guye, Yesuusa Xibaaroosa Abba kale fa tamaaritayis maaqqii bentteeza. E unttis yhaypp kaallii yez hanor benteeza. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simoon Phixiroosa, Didimoosa ginttinttiz Toomaasa, Qaana Galilap ye7eez Naatina7eela, Zabidoosa na7itayinnee Yesuusa tamaaritaypp hara nam7itay wolla yeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simoon Phixiroosa unttiko, «Taanii molo aykkodayis yhanigiza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Unttii, «Nuukka neer yhammada» yeegii, wogolo gancce geleeza. Zin unttii ye qamma aba molokka aykkekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Wontta guura xalqqe dolodayipp tiina, Yesuusa abba gaxa eqqeeza, zin e tamaaritay Yesuusa maaqqeezana erbe7ekkaya. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Ta laggitayyo, molo aykkekasa?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Unttii mahii, «Akkokka aykkekkaya» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>E mahii, «Yi gita wogolaypp ushachchi baggar oloytta; yi molo aykkoda» yeegeeza. Yeyi gishos, unttii gita ushachchi baggar oleeza. Molay gaanggeez gishos goochchii kessodayis gammintteeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Yesuusa qaadhiza tamaaray Phixiroosako, «Yhayi Goda bayi!» yeegeeza. Simoon Phixiroosa E geezana si7ii kallo yez gishos fa afila ma77ii abba giddo guppii gelleeza. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Zin wogolo giddo atteez yhankko tamaaritay molo kumeez gita goochchii, abbapi gaxa kezeeza. U abbapi nam77ii xeet yhadhay garkk haakkiza zini. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Unttii abbapp gaxa kezeez wode xiife qaaqar molo yezannee soollo be7eeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yhatti yi aykkeez molaypp xiqqa yhana inggoytta» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simoon Phixiroosa wogolite gelii, xeeti ishatammannee hayidzii dammo molitay kumeez gita goochchii abbapp gaxa kessezza. Molay yey garkk gaame maaqqikonnee gitay feedhdhinttekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesuusa unttiko, «Yhana yi7ii moytta» yeegeeza. E Goda maaqqeezana unttii ereez gishos e tamaaritaypp pettayika, «Neenii oonoo?» gi eza oyicodayis yibatteezay baaya. E Goda maaqqeezana ubbitay ereeza <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesuusa yi7ii, soollo ekkii unttisi inggeeza; molakka yhay garkk inggeeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yesuusa yhayiqopp denddii fa tamaaritayis benttodar yhayi hayidzantho.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusarannee Phixiroosara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>U meezaypp guye, Yesuusa Simoon Phixiroosako, «Yoona na7a Simoona, tana yhayttitaypp aathii qadhinnee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Simoon Phixiroosa, «Ee Godayyo, taanii nena qadhdhizana ne eriza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesuusa eziko, «Ta dur na7unthan heenggoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yesuusa nam7antho, «Yoona na7a Simoona, tana qadhdhinee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Simoon Phixiroosa, «Ee Godayyo, taanii nena qadhdhizana ne eriza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesuusa, «Ta hooggita heenggoba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yesuusa hayidzantho, «Yoona na7ayyo Simoona, tana qadhdhinee?» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusa hayidzantho Simoon Phixiroosako, «Tana qadhdhinee?» yeegii oycceez gishos Phixiroosa azzanii, «Godayyo, neenii ubba baz eriza; taanii nena qadhdhizana ne eriza» yeegeeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusa, «Ta durita heenggoba. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Taanii nees turo odiza; neenii na7atithar yez wode ne aaddas danccinttii, ne kozheez bessi yhanigiza. Zin ne cimeez wode ne kusha miccii beezoda. Haray danccisoda; ne aqo bessi kanggoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesuusa yeya Phixiroosa ab garkk yhayiqo yhayqqii, Xoossa bonchchisodazikko erisodayis geeza. Yeya geezaypp guye, Yesuusa Phixiroosako, «Tana kaalloba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusarannee yhankko tamaara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Phixiroosa guye maaqqii, Yesuusa qaadhiza tamaaray faapi guyer yi7izana be7eeza. Ye tamaaray, kaho miiz aqo Yesuusako shiiqii, «Godayyo, nena aathii immaday oonoo?» geezana. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Phixiroosa ye tamaara bi7ii, «Godayyo, yha athay ma wayadee?» yeegii Yesuusa oyceeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesuusa eziko, «Taanii ye7oda hellodayis E shemppor yezod garkk taanii koyko, yeyi nena abi metenee? Neenii tana kaalloba» yeegeeza.<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Yeyi gishos, ye tamaaray yhayqqaam giz oday e ishita ubbita helleeza. Zin Yesuusa, «Taanii ye7od gatho, E yezod garkk taanii koyko nena abi metenee?» yegeezaypp attin «Yhayqqenna» geekkaya.<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Yha oday bagga markkattezaynne yhaya xaafeezay ye tamaara. E markkatithay tuma maaqqizana nuunii eriza.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yesuusa ootheez hara gaame baz yeza. Ta qoppin, ubba baz ommar ommar xaafintteezako, xaafinttiza maxaafitayis kunithi alamay gidodibaz aazooya.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
